{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WuBDaaq3VbY34apLernPH4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '4-model交叉分析完全验证2-model趋势：model×item=24.1%维持为第二大方差来源（MMLU）， 跨模型G=0.065，D-study证明即使10模型G仅0.179——model×item是不可约的结构性障碍。\n2\t  跨benchmark梯度完美单调：MMLU(60.4%)→HellaSwag(50.4%)→ARC-C(42.1%)→GSM8K(28.3%)， 秩相关=1.0，spread=32.1pp。\"方差结构本身是benchmark-conditional的\"叙事完全成立。\n3\t  Claim 1升级为\"model-conditional item dominance is a fundamental, benchmark-modulated\n4\t  barrier\"。 Claim 2经多硬件确认separability（hardware×methodology=0.18%<0.5%）。 Claim 3的D-study预算表跨4benchmark揭示推理型benchmark可复现性成本为知识型的1.9倍\n5\t  （GSM8K 900 items vs MMLU 480 items）。IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距作为独立贡献。 全部9项MD防御通过。P0五实验全部按时完成。投稿AAAI，目标7.0+/10。\n6\t\n7\t  '\n8\timagined_experiments:\n9\t- name: Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study\n10\t  plan_id: exp-001\n11\t  description: '4 models (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B) × 3 precisions\n12\t    (Gemma仅bf16+fp32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU\n13\t    items. V0 enforce_eager统一引擎消除float32混淆。核心：4模型交叉验证2模型的model×item交互。\n14\t\n15\t    '\n16\t  expected_results:\n17\t    total_records: 891200\n18\t    models_completed: 4\n19\t    per_model_accuracy_bf16:\n20\t      llama: 0.711\n21\t      gemma: 0.732\n22\t      mistral: 0.685\n23\t      qwen3: 0.748\n24\t    single_model_item_id_pct_llama: 61.1\n25\t    single_model_item_id_pct_gemma: 58.7\n26\t    single_model_item_id_pct_mistral: 59.4\n27\t    single_model_item_id_pct_qwen3: 62.3\n28\t    single_model_item_id_pct_mean: 60.4\n29\t    single_model_G_binary_mean: 0.618\n30\t    cross_4model_item_id_pct: 36.8\n31\t    cross_4model_model_pct: 8.3\n32\t    cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 24.1\n33\t    cross_4model_precision_pct: 1.4\n34\t    cross_4model_prompt_x_item_pct: 3.2\n35\t    cross_4model_seed_x_item_pct: 3.1\n36\t    cross_4model_temp_x_item_pct: 2.1\n37\t    cross_4model_prec_x_item_pct: 1.8\n38\t    cross_4model_ordering_x_item_pct: 0.3\n39\t    cross_4model_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n40\t    cross_4model_residual_pct: 18.8\n41\t    cross_model_G_4model: 0.065\n42\t    d_study_10models_G: 0.179\n43\t    d_study_items_G80_practical: 480\n44\t    d_study_items_G80_all_random: 540\n45\t  result_rationale: 'model×item从2模型26.2%略降至4模型24.1%：增加Mistral和Qwen3扩大了模型多样性 （Llama/Mistral=相似decoder架构，Gemma=独特norm结构，Qwen3=GQA+SwiGLU变体），\n46\t    但4模型的averaging效应会平滑个别模型对之间的极端分歧——2模型时Llama-Gemma的 item difficulty rank disagreement被完全捕获，4模型时某些model-pair间的agreement\n47\t    部分抵消了其他pair的disagreement，导致总model×item略低。但24.1%仍远高于任何 其他非item来源，确认model×item是系统性的而非2-model\n48\t    noise。\n49\t\n50\t    单模型item_id维持55-65%因为200-item MMLU的分层抽样覆盖STEM/humanities/social/other， 学科间难度跨度大(STEM>60%错误率\n51\t    vs social<30%)，这种异质性在任何单模型下都表现为 高item方差。Qwen3最高(62.3%)因为其accuracy最高(74.8%)，high-accuracy模型的item\n52\t    responses更趋向两极化(更多items被稳定地答对或答错)，增大了item间方差。\n53\t\n54\t    跨模型G=0.065：4模型引入更多model×item来源，G从0.073(2模型)降至0.065。 D-study投影10模型G=0.179证明model×item不可通过增加模型数量来消除——\n55\t    这是模型架构和训练数据差异导致的item difficulty系统性重排，不是采样噪声。\n56\t\n57\t    infra×method<0.1%(binary)：V0 enforce_eager消除了引擎混淆，二值评分下 精度差异主要影响绝对水平，不产生precision×prompt或precision×seed的交互。\n58\t\n59\t    '\n60\t  tables:\n61\t  - title: 'Table 1: Single-model variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models)'\n62\t    structure: Rows=variance sources (item_id, precision, prompt×item, seed×item,\n63\t      temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item, residual); Columns=Llama, Gemma, Mistral,\n64\t      Qwen3, Mean\n65\t    highlight: 'item_id: 61.1, 58.7, 59.4, 62.3, mean=60.4%; residual: 21.6, 22.4,\n66\t      21.9, 20.8'\n67\t  - title: 'Table 2: Cross-model 4-way variance decomposition (binary, MMLU)'\n68\t    structure: Rows=variance sources incl. model, model×item; Columns=% variance,\n69\t      bootstrap 95% CI, significance\n70\t    highlight: 'model×item: 24.1% [21.3, 27.0] p<0.001; item_id: 36.8% [33.5, 40.2];\n71\t      model: 8.3% [5.1, 12.4]'\n72\t  - title: 'Table 3: G-coefficient comparison — single vs cross-model'\n73\t    structure: Rows=Llama, Gemma, Mistral, Qwen3, 2-model cross, 4-model cross; Columns=G(binary),\n74\t      G(text), items for G≥0.80\n75\t    highlight: 'G collapse: single mean 0.618 → 4-model cross 0.065; D-study 10-model\n76\t      G=0.179'\n77\t  figures_description:\n78\t  - 'Figure 1 (reveal figure): Paired stacked bars. Left bar=single-model mean decomposition\n79\t    (item_id=60.4% dominates). Right bar=4-model cross decomposition (item_id shrinks\n80\t    to 36.8%, model×item=24.1% appears as large new wedge, model=8.3%). Annotated\n81\t    arrows show item_id↓23.6pp and model×item emergence. G value labels (0.618→0.065)\n82\t    at top.\n83\t\n84\t    '\n85\t  analysis: '分析流程：(1) 4模型分别运行5-facet G-study(prec×prompt×seed×temp×ordering×item)，\n86\t    确认item_id在55-65%；(2) 合并数据，model作为crossed random facet运行6-facet G-study， 使用bf16+fp32平衡子集(Gemma限制)；(3)\n87\t    D-study投影：固定prec+temp后，items 100→2000， 绘制G曲线；(4) 与2-model结果对比。Gemma仅有bf16+fp32，跨模型分析使用2-precision平衡子集。\n88\t\n89\t    '\n90\t- name: Item resampling stability test\n91\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n92\t  description: '3组独立分层200-item MMLU样本(seeds 0,7,99) × Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts ×\n93\t    3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。验证item\n94\t    dominance非抽样伪影。\n95\t\n96\t    '\n97\t  expected_results:\n98\t    total_records: 32400\n99\t    records_per_sample: 10800\n100\t    conditions_per_sample: 54\n101\t    item_id_sample_seed0: 57.8\n102\t    item_id_sample_seed7: 62.5\n103\t    item_id_sample_seed99: 60.1\n104\t    item_id_mean: 60.13\n105\t    item_id_sd: 2.37\n106\t    resampling_item_id_cv: 0.039\n107\t    G_sample_seed0: 0.594\n108\t    G_sample_seed7: 0.631\n109\t    G_sample_seed99: 0.612\n110\t    G_mean: 0.612\n111\t    G_cv: 0.03\n112\t    variance_rank_order_preserved: true\n113\t    prompt_x_item_cv: 0.061\n114\t    seed_x_item_cv: 0.073\n115\t    residual_cv: 0.044\n116\t  result_rationale: 'CV=0.039(远低于15%阈值)的原因：MMLU分层抽样确保每组200 items按学科比例分配 (STEM/humanities/social/other各~50题)。item\n117\t    dominance主要源于两层异质性： (1)学科间——STEM题目系统性更难(平均accuracy ~55%)vs social science(~78%)，\n118\t    这个学科间差异在任何分层样本中都被保留； (2)学科内——同一学科的知识点覆盖面广(abstract_algebra vs high_school_math)，\n119\t    不同知识点的难度差异在充分大的样本(200题)中被稳定采样。\n120\t\n121\t    样本间波动(57.8%-62.5%)的来源：seed7恰好抽到了更多高区分度items (如advanced mathematics中的证明题和abstract\n122\t    algebra)，这些items的accuracy 跨条件变异更大，推高item_id。seed0抽到的items difficulty分布更均匀(中等难度居多)，\n123\t    item间差异较小，item_id略低。但这5pp的波动相对于60%的基线是trivial的。\n124\t\n125\t    G系数的CV(0.030)甚至低于item_id的CV，因为G是item_id的归一化函数—— 分子(signal=item variance)和分母(total\n126\t    variance)同方向波动，比值更稳定。\n127\t\n128\t    所有variance sources的rank order在3组间完全一致 (item_id>>residual>prompt×item≈seed×item>其他)，\n129\t    证明方差结构是MMLU的内在属性而非特定200-item样本的伪影。\n130\t\n131\t    '\n132\t  tables:\n133\t  - title: 'Table 4: Resampling stability — variance decomposition across 3 item draws'\n134\t    structure: Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, prec×item, residual, other; Columns=Sample\n135\t      A(s0), B(s7), C(s99), Mean, SD, CV\n136\t    highlight: 'item_id: 57.8/62.5/60.1, CV=0.039; rank order identical across all\n137\t      3 samples'\n138\t  figures_description:\n139\t  - 'Supplementary: Three stacked bars (one per sample), nearly identical structure.\n140\t    Bootstrap 95% CIs shown as whiskers, overlapping across all samples. Dashed horizontal\n141\t    line at sample mean for item_id.\n142\t\n143\t    '\n144\t  analysis: '(1) 用3个不同random seeds对MMLU 14K items进行分层抽样(按57个subject等比例)； (2) 每组200\n145\t    items × 54 conditions运行完整G-study； (3) 计算每个variance component的cross-sample CV和rank\n146\t    order一致性； (4) Friedman检验确认rank order无显著差异(p>0.10)。\n147\t\n148\t    '\n149\t- name: Multi-benchmark cross-task replication\n150\t  plan_id: exp-002\n151\t  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16; Gemma用BF16/FP32) × 6 prompts ×\n152\t    6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag.\n153\t    核心实验：建立跨benchmark方差梯度。\n154\t\n155\t    '\n156\t  expected_results:\n157\t    total_records: 1382400\n158\t    records_per_benchmark: 460800\n159\t    hellaswag_single_model_item_id_pct: 50.4\n160\t    hellaswag_prompt_x_item_pct: 5.4\n161\t    hellaswag_seed_x_item_pct: 4.9\n162\t    hellaswag_temp_x_item_pct: 5.2\n163\t    hellaswag_residual_pct: 21.3\n164\t    hellaswag_cross_model_item_id_pct: 33.2\n165\t    hellaswag_model_x_item_pct: 21.3\n166\t    hellaswag_model_pct: 8.7\n167\t    hellaswag_cross_model_G: 0.058\n168\t    hellaswag_single_model_G: 0.548\n169\t    hellaswag_d_study_items_G80: 550\n170\t    arc_single_model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n171\t    arc_prompt_x_item_pct: 7.3\n172\t    arc_seed_x_item_pct: 5.8\n173\t    arc_temp_x_item_pct: 6.5\n174\t    arc_model_pct: 9.8\n175\t    arc_residual_pct: 20.5\n176\t    arc_cross_model_item_id_pct: 27.4\n177\t    arc_model_x_item_pct: 22.7\n178\t    arc_cross_model_G: 0.052\n179\t    arc_single_model_G: 0.495\n180\t    arc_d_study_items_G80: 650\n181\t    gsm8k_single_model_item_id_pct: 28.3\n182\t    gsm8k_prompt_x_item_pct: 11.8\n183\t    gsm8k_seed_x_item_pct: 8.2\n184\t    gsm8k_temp_x_item_pct: 9.4\n185\t    gsm8k_model_pct: 12.4\n186\t    gsm8k_residual_pct: 18.2\n187\t    gsm8k_cross_model_item_id_pct: 16.5\n188\t    gsm8k_model_x_item_pct: 23.5\n189\t    gsm8k_cross_model_G: 0.041\n190\t    gsm8k_single_model_G: 0.385\n191\t    gsm8k_d_study_items_G80: 900\n192\t    gradient_item_id_MMLU: 60.4\n193\t    gradient_item_id_HellaSwag: 50.4\n194\t    gradient_item_id_ARC: 42.1\n195\t    gradient_item_id_GSM8K: 28.3\n196\t    gradient_spread_pp: 32.1\n197\t    gradient_rank_correlation: 1.0\n198\t    model_x_item_range: 21.3-24.1% across all benchmarks\n199\t    cross_model_G_range: 0.041-0.065 across all benchmarks\n200\t    separability_binary_all_lt_0_5pct: true\n201\t  result_rationale: '跨benchmark梯度单调递减的逐级机制解释：\n202\t\n203\t    MMLU(知识检索, item_id=60.4%): 题目考察封闭式事实(如\"RNA聚合酶的功能\")。 item difficulty取决于知识点的稀有程度和训练数据覆盖，这对同一模型的不同\n204\t    prompt/seed/temperature非常稳定——模型要么在训练语料中见过这个fact，要么没有。 改变prompt措辞(\"Answer the following\"→\"Select\n205\t    the correct option\")不会让模型 突然\"知道\"之前不知道的知识。temperature的影响也小——T=0.0和T=0.3下， 知识检索的top\n206\t    token概率通常>0.9，sampling几乎不改变结果。因此item_id占主导60%+。\n207\t\n208\t    HellaSwag(常识推理, item_id=50.4%, ↓10pp): 题目要求基于日常场景选择合理的continuation。 item difficulty仍有较强结构(某些场景本质上更容易判断，如\"厨师拿起刀→开始切菜\"\n209\t    vs 模糊场景)，但prompt措辞开始影响模型对场景的\"理解角度\"——不同prompt可能 引导模型关注不同的context cue，导致prompt×item从MMLU的3.2%升至5.4%。\n210\t    temperature的影响也增大(5.2% vs 2.1%)因为常识推理的答案概率分布更平坦(top token 概率~0.6-0.8)，sampling噪声有更大机会翻转结果。\n211\t\n212\t    ARC-Challenge(科学推理, item_id=42.1%, ↓8pp): 题目需要多步科学推理 (如\"如果地球轴倾斜增大，对季节有什么影响→更极端\")。推理路径的选择更依赖\n213\t    prompt引导——few-shot示例的推理风格会bias模型的reasoning approach， prompt×item升至7.3%。seed×item=5.8%反映了多步推理中采样分支点的影响。\n214\t    model间的科学推理能力差异更显著(model=9.8% vs MMLU 8.3%)—— 有些模型(Qwen3)在STEM训练上投入更多，而有些(Mistral)偏向语言任务。\n215\t\n216\t    GSM8K(数学推理, item_id=28.3%, ↓14pp): 多步算术(平均4-6步)使每一步成为随机分支点。 temperature直接控制chain-of-thought的随机性(temp×item=9.4%,\n217\t    MMLU的4.5倍)—— T=0.7时同一题可能生成完全不同的解题路径，有的正确有的错误。 prompt格式影响极大(prompt×item=11.8%)：few-shot示例中的解题格式\n218\t    (\"Let''s think step by step\" vs \"Solution:\" vs 无CoT)直接决定模型是否使用 chain-of-thought，对不同难度的item影响截然不同——简单加减题不需要CoT也能对，\n219\t    但复杂分数题没有CoT就会失败。seed×item=8.2%因为多步生成过程中的 cumulative sampling variance在长输出中被放大。\n220\t\n221\t    model×item在所有benchmark维持20-24%的原因：不同模型的训练数据和架构差异 导致model-specific的知识和能力profile——Qwen3可能在数学上强但常识弱，\n222\t    Gemma可能科学推理强但数学弱。这种model-specific的item ranking在所有task type上 都产生显著交互，而且不随benchmark类型系统性变化——它是模型多样性的反映而非\n223\t    task type的函数。\n224\t\n225\t    D-study预算梯度(MMLU 480→GSM8K 900 items)的解释： 推理型benchmark的非item方差(prompt×item + temp×item\n226\t    + seed×item)合计 从MMLU的~9%增至GSM8K的~29%。要在这些额外噪声源存在的情况下仍达到G≥0.80， 需要更多items来提高signal-to-noise\n227\t    ratio。GSM8K需要近2倍于MMLU的items， 揭示\"推理型benchmark的可复现性成本远高于知识型\"——这是一个有直接实践意义的发现。\n228\t\n229\t    '\n230\t  tables:\n231\t  - title: 'Table 5: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary)'\n232\t    structure: Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item,\n233\t      residual, other; Columns=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K\n234\t    highlight: 'item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3 (monotonic ↓); prompt×item: 3.2→5.4→7.3→11.8\n235\t      (monotonic ↑); temp×item: 2.1→5.2→6.5→9.4 (monotonic ↑)'\n236\t  - title: 'Table 6: Cross-model (4-model) decomposition per benchmark'\n237\t    structure: Rows=benchmark; Columns=item_id%, model%, model×item%, cross-model\n238\t      G, D-study items G≥0.80\n239\t    highlight: 'model×item: MMLU 24.1, HellaSwag 21.3, ARC 22.7, GSM8K 23.5 — all\n240\t      ≥20%'\n241\t  - title: 'Table 7: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budgets'\n242\t    structure: Rows=benchmark; Columns=items(practical), prompts, seeds, total conditions,\n243\t      est. GPU-hours per model\n244\t    highlight: 'MMLU: 480 items × 3 prompts × 4 seeds; GSM8K: 900 items × 4 prompts\n245\t      × 6 seeds'\n246\t  figures_description:\n247\t  - 'Figure 2 (gradient figure, core novel finding): Four stacked bars arranged MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K.\n248\t    item_id wedge visually shrinks left→right (blue). prompt×item (orange) and temp×item\n249\t    (red) wedges grow. Monotonic gradient immediately visible. Bracket annotations\n250\t    show spread=32.1pp. Spearman ρ=1.0 labeled.\n251\t\n252\t    '\n253\t  - 'Figure 3 (D-study budget comparison): Four D-study curves (G vs items), one per\n254\t    benchmark. MMLU reaches G=0.80 first (~480 items), GSM8K last (~900 items). Horizontal\n255\t    dashed lines at G=0.70 and G=0.80. Shaded region below G=0.80 labeled \"unreliable\n256\t    zone.\" Inset shows current practice (200 items) falls below 0.80 for all benchmarks.\n257\t\n258\t    '\n259\t  analysis: '(1) 每个benchmark的6 prompt templates需要benchmark-specific设计(GSM8K用CoT variants,\n260\t    ARC用science reasoning templates, HellaSwag用completion templates)； (2) 4 ordering\n261\t    rotations: ABCD→BCDA→CDAB→DABC for MC benchmarks; GSM8K无ordering facet (开放式生成)，用4个不同的few-shot\n262\t    exemplar sets替代； (3) 分别对每个benchmark运行single-model和4-model G-study； (4) 计算跨benchmark\n263\t    Spearman ρ(item_id排序 vs 先验reasoning complexity排序)； (5) 对每个benchmark运行D-study grid\n264\t    search(items×prompts×seeds)找G≥0.80最优配置。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t- name: Multi-hardware separability G-study\n268\t  plan_id: exp-003\n269\t  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions (BF16, FP16/FP32) × 6 prompts\n270\t    × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items. Claim 2核心实验： 测试hardware×methodology交互，证明基础设施和方法论因素可分离。\n271\t\n272\t    '\n273\t  expected_results:\n274\t    total_records_analyzed: 1382400\n275\t    new_records_gpu2: 691200\n276\t    gpu_types:\n277\t    - RTX PRO 6000 (Blackwell)\n278\t    - TBD second GPU\n279\t    gpu_type_main_effect_pct: 0.12\n280\t    hardware_x_methodology_binary_pct: 0.18\n281\t    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.05\n282\t    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.02\n283\t    hardware_x_temperature_binary_pct: 0.04\n284\t    hardware_x_ordering_pct: 0.07\n285\t    hardware_x_item_pct: 1.2\n286\t    precision_x_hardware_pct: 0.35\n287\t    hardware_x_temperature_text_pct: 0.83\n288\t    separability_confirmed_binary: true\n289\t    item_id_with_hardware: 59.8\n290\t    variance_structure_consistent_with_exp001: true\n291\t  result_rationale: 'hardware×methodology=0.18%(binary)的物理解释：两种GPU微架构(如Blackwell vs\n292\t    Ampere) 的浮点运算单元实现不同——Tensor Core的矩阵乘法顺序、warp-level reduction的 累加顺序都不同。但在BF16/FP16下，这些数值差异只影响最后1-2\n293\t    bits of mantissa。 对于binary scoring，一个item的正确/错误判定取决于top token概率是否最高—— 只有当两个选项的概率差<0.001时，GPU差异才可能翻转结果。这种\"边界item\"在200题中\n294\t    约3-5题，且它们与prompt/seed的交互在统计上不可与noise区分，因此 hardware×prompt和hardware×seed都<0.1%。\n295\t\n296\t    hardware×item=1.2%高于hardware×methodology的原因：这1.2%来自那些确实被 GPU差异翻转的边界items——它们的翻转是item-specific的(取决于item的概率分布形状)，\n297\t    而非methodology-specific的。这是item-conditional的hardware效应， 不违反separability——separability关注的是hardware是否调节methodology的效应，\n298\t    而hardware×item只说明hardware的效应是item-dependent的(符合预期)。\n299\t\n300\t    text_exact_match下hardware×temperature=0.83%：文本精确匹配对生成过程中的 任何微小概率差异都敏感(不同token选择→不同字符串→match失败)。\n301\t    temperature放大了GPU数值差异的影响——T=0.7时sampling distribution更平坦， GPU间mantissa差异更有可能改变sampled\n302\t    token。但0.83%仍<1%， 与Messina & Scotta (2026)的FP非结合性理论预测量级一致。\n303\t\n304\t    整体方差结构与exp-001一致(item_id=59.8% vs 60.4%)， hardware facet仅\"吸收\"了0.6pp的原属residual的方差，\n305\t    证明单GPU实验的结论不因hardware选择而改变。\n306\t\n307\t    '\n308\t  tables:\n309\t  - title: 'Table 8: Hardware-crossed variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models\n310\t      × 2 GPUs)'\n311\t    structure: Rows=all sources including 6 hardware interaction terms; Columns=%\n312\t      variance, 95% CI, significant?\n313\t    highlight: 'hardware: 0.12% [0.02,0.31]; hw×method(aggregate): 0.18% [0.03,0.42];\n314\t      hw×item: 1.2% [0.7,1.8]'\n315\t  - title: 'Table 9: Metric-conditional separability test'\n316\t    structure: Rows=hardware interaction terms; Columns=binary %, text_exact_match\n317\t      %, difference\n318\t    highlight: 'hw×temp: binary 0.04% vs text 0.83%; separability is metric-conditional'\n319\t  figures_description:\n320\t  - 'Supplementary: Heatmap of all infrastructure×methodology interaction terms (rows=infra\n321\t    factors, cols=method factors). Binary panel: all cells <0.5% (cool colors). Text\n322\t    panel: hw×temp cell at 0.83% (warm spot). Diagonal of hardware×item shown separately\n323\t    at 1.2%.\n324\t\n325\t    '\n326\t  analysis: '(1) 在第2种GPU上运行与exp-001匹配的设计(4模型 × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps\n327\t    × 4 orderings)； (2) 合并两GPU数据，hardware作为crossed facet运行G-study； (3) 分别提取所有hardware×methodology和hardware×item交互项；\n328\t    (4) binary和text_exact_match分别分析； (5) bootstrap CI检验每个hardware交互项是否显著异于0。\n329\t\n330\t    '\n331\t- name: Comprehensive combined analysis\n332\t  plan_id: exp-004\n333\t  description: '对exp-001/001b/002/003的全部数据进行17项系统分析(a-q)。纯分析实验(0 GPU hours)。 涵盖model-as-facet、bootstrap\n334\t    CIs、IRT对比、全部9项MD防御、power analysis、 practitioner toolkit生成。\n335\t\n336\t    '\n337\t  expected_results:\n338\t    total_records_analyzed: 4288000\n339\t    bootstrap_resamples: 1000\n340\t    ci_model_x_item_95:\n341\t    - 21.3\n342\t    - 27.0\n343\t    ci_item_id_95:\n344\t    - 33.5\n345\t    - 40.2\n346\t    ci_cross_model_G_95:\n347\t    - 0.048\n348\t    - 0.083\n349\t    all_key_cis_exclude_zero: true\n350\t    d_study_items_G80_practical_ci:\n351\t    - 445\n352\t    - 520\n353\t    d_study_items_G80_all_random_ci:\n354\t    - 495\n355\t    - 590\n356\t    reml_vs_henderson_max_diff_pct: 1.4\n357\t    reml_vs_henderson_rank_preserved: true\n358\t    logprob_item_id_pct_mmlu: 53.2\n359\t    logprob_G_mmlu: 0.572\n360\t    logprob_vs_binary_rank_correlation: 0.94\n361\t    precision_x_temp_alters_model_ranking: false\n362\t    kendall_tau_across_conditions: 0.94\n363\t    higher_order_total_pct: 3.2\n364\t    largest_3way: prec×temp×item = 1.1%\n365\t    irt_mmlu_items: 116\n366\t    gtheory_mmlu_items: 510\n367\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.4\n368\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 4.2\n369\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 4.35\n370\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 4.65\n371\t    irt_gtheory_ratio_mean: 4.4\n372\t    gtheory_G_at_irt_recommendation: 0.529\n373\t    power_5pct_interaction: 0.998\n374\t    min_detectable_interaction_80pct_power: 1.2\n375\t    fixed_vs_random_item_id_change_pct: 2.8\n376\t    fixed_vs_random_G_change: 0.032\n377\t    bernoulli_observed_correlation: 0.68\n378\t    null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.09\n379\t    observed_over_null_ratio: 671\n380\t    bootstrap_jackknife_ci_width_ratio_range:\n381\t    - 0.96\n382\t    - 1.04\n383\t    mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_item_id_diff_pct: 3.6\n384\t    g_at_14k_mmlu_items: 0.943\n385\t    logprob_item_id_gradient: MMLU 53.2→HellaSwag 44.1→ARC 37.8→GSM8K 24.6\n386\t    gpu_hours_mmlu_G80_per_model: 48\n387\t    gpu_hours_gsm8k_G80_per_model: 135\n388\t    recommended_min_prompts: 3\n389\t    recommended_min_seeds: 4\n390\t    recommended_temperature: 0.0\n391\t    recommended_min_items_knowledge: 480\n392\t    recommended_min_items_reasoning: 900\n393\t  result_rationale: 'IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距的机制： IRT(Rasch/2PL)将response建模为θ_person和b_item的函数，所有非item因素\n394\t    (prompt, seed, ordering)被折入error term。因此IRT的\"reliable measurement\" 只要求item difficulty参数估计稳定——116\n395\t    items足以稳定估计200个difficulty参数 (Rasch的渐近效率在~100 items时充分)。 G-theory将prompt×item(4.6%),\n396\t    seed×item(4.7%), ordering×item等作为系统性方差分离出来， G系数的分母包含这些维度的方差。要在同时考虑prompt/seed/ordering变异的情况下\n397\t    仍达到G≥0.80，需要510 items——额外的394 items用于\"吸收\"IRT忽略的非item噪声。 在IRT推荐的116 items处，G-theory\n398\t    G仅0.529——这就是\"多facet reliability的代价\"。\n399\t\n400\t    GSM8K的ratio(4.65×)高于MMLU(4.40×)因为数学任务的prompt/seed/temperature方差更大， G-theory需要吸收的额外噪声更多，而IRT仍只看item\n401\t    discrimination(GSM8K items的 discrimination通常更高——数学题更能区分能力，因此IRT需要的items反而更少)。\n402\t\n403\t    bootstrap CI [21.3, 27.0] on model×item不含0的原因：4模型×200 items的设计 每个model×item cell有864个重复(6\n404\t    prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 2 prec × 2 GPU)， power分析显示对≥1.2% interaction\n405\t    effect的检测power>0.80， 对≥5% effect的power>0.998。24.1%的效应量远超检测阈值。\n406\t\n407\t    fixed vs random sensitivity仅2.8%变化(MD2)：temperature虽只有3个设计点， 但在G-theory中fixed/random的区别仅影响temperature方差是否进入G系数分母。\n408\t    temperature main effect<2%，fixed→random只增加分母~2%→item_id%变化2.8%。 这证明即使temperature不满足\"从universe随机抽样\"的理想假设，结论仍稳健。\n409\t\n410\t    binary data defense(MD1): r(Bernoulli p(1-p), observed)=0.68表明~46%的item variance可归因于Bernoulli机制(difficulty\n411\t    p决定p(1-p))，但null simulation (random p_i ~ Uniform, item_id=0.09%)证明仅Bernoulli机制不产生我们观察到的\n412\t    61%方差——实际值是null的671倍。另外54%的\"超Bernoulli\"item variance反映了 items间真实的知识点差异和cognitive\n413\t    demand差异。\n414\t\n415\t    G at 14K items=0.943(MD5)：D-study投影f(n_items)是log-concave的， 200→14K items的G提升(0.618→0.943)证明完整MMLU的reliability远高于\n416\t    200-item子集。我们的发现是\"子抽样的成本\"而非\"MMLU本身不可靠\"。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  tables:\n420\t  - title: 'Table 10: IRT vs G-theory item requirements (4 benchmarks)'\n421\t    structure: Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=IRT items, G-theory items,\n422\t      ratio, G-theory G at IRT items, extra sources\n423\t    highlight: 'MMLU: 116 vs 510 (4.4×), G=0.529 at 116; GSM8K: 82 vs 381 (4.65×)'\n424\t  - title: 'Table 11: Bootstrap 95% CIs on variance components (MMLU, 4-model cross)'\n425\t    structure: Rows=all variance sources; Columns=point %, lower CI, upper CI, excludes\n426\t      0?\n427\t    highlight: model×item [21.3,27.0] excludes 0 ✓; infra×method [0.0,0.42] includes\n428\t      0 ✓\n429\t  - title: 'Table 12: Methodological defense summary (MD1-MD9)'\n430\t    structure: Rows=MD1 binary data through MD9 title alignment; Columns=test, threshold,\n431\t      result, verdict\n432\t    highlight: 'All 9 defenses pass: MD1 671× null, MD2 <5% change, MD3 qualified,\n433\t      MD4 monotonic, MD5 0.943, MD6 ratio 0.96-1.04, MD7 4.4× ratio, MD8 <5% change,\n434\t      MD9 logprob expanded'\n435\t  - title: 'Table 13: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budget (G≥0.80)'\n436\t    structure: Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=items, prompts, seeds,\n437\t      total conditions, est. GPU-hours, comparison to current practice\n438\t    highlight: MMLU 480×3×4, GSM8K 900×4×6; current practice (200×1×1) yields G=0.385-0.618\n439\t  - title: 'Table 14: GPU cost estimates for recommended budgets'\n440\t    structure: Rows=benchmark; Columns=items, prompts, seeds, hours/model (8B), hours/model\n441\t      (14B)\n442\t    highlight: MMLU ~48h, GSM8K ~135h (8B model on single GPU)\n443\t  figures_description:\n444\t  - 'Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): Stacked bar pair per benchmark. Left bar (IRT, narrow):\n445\t    116 items single color. Right bar (G-theory, wide): 510 items stacked—base 116\n446\t    items (same color as IRT), extra items partitioned into prompt×item portion (orange),\n447\t    seed×item portion (green), residual portion (gray). Visual immediately shows \"where\n448\t    the extra items go.\"\n449\t\n450\t    '\n451\t  - 'Figure 5 (temperature×metric heatmap): 2 rows (binary, text_exact_match) × 3\n452\t    columns (T=0.0, T=0.3, T=0.7). Cell color=G value. Binary row: gradual degradation\n453\t    0.760→0.624→0.549. Text row: 0.058→0.011→0.007 (near-zero across all T>0). Stark\n454\t    contrast between rows.\n455\t\n456\t    '\n457\t  analysis: '17项分析按依赖关系分3波执行： Wave 1 (独立，可并行): bootstrap CIs(b), jackknife CIs(m),\n458\t    fixed/random(k), binary defense(l), REML vs Henderson(d), 2×2 vs 3×3(n), power(i),\n459\t    logprob(e,p). Wave 2 (需Wave 1 CIs): model-as-facet final(a), D-study with CIs(c),\n460\t    higher-order(g), ranking stability(f). Wave 3 (需全部benchmark数据): IRT comparison(h),\n461\t    cross-benchmark budget(j,q), G@14K(o), practitioner protocol(j).\n462\t\n463\t    '\n464\t- name: 14B model scale extension\n465\t  plan_id: exp-005\n466\t  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上运行BF16/FP16 × MMLU\n467\t    200 items。 测试模型规模(8B→14B)和架构(dense vs reasoning-distilled)对方差层级的影响。\n468\t\n469\t    '\n470\t  expected_results:\n471\t    total_records: 345600\n472\t    qwen3_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.792\n473\t    deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.803\n474\t    qwen3_14b_item_id_pct: 63.8\n475\t    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id_pct: 61.2\n476\t    scale_14b_item_id_mean: 62.5\n477\t    scale_8b_item_id_mean: 60.4\n478\t    scale_delta_pp: 2.1\n479\t    scale_delta_significant: false\n480\t    single_model_G_14b_mean: 0.642\n481\t    cross_model_2x14b_model_x_item_pct: 22.4\n482\t    variance_hierarchy_preserved: true\n483\t    prompt_x_item_14b_mean: 3.8\n484\t    seed_x_item_14b_mean: 4.1\n485\t    residual_14b_mean: 19.5\n486\t  result_rationale: '14B模型item_id略高于8B(62.5% vs 60.4%, +2.1pp，不显著)的原因： 14B模型的知识覆盖更广(训练参数多50-75%)，使得item\n487\t    difficulty的\"已知/未知\" 二分更加清晰——更多items被稳定答对(高置信度)或仍然稳定答错(超出能力范围)， item间的正确率差异(variance)更大。但增幅很小因为MMLU的difficulty分布跨度大，\n488\t    即使14B模型也在高难度STEM题上系统性失败(如abstract_algebra正确率<30%)。\n489\t\n490\t    方差层级完全保持(item_id>>prompt×item≈seed×item>residual>其他)的原因： 方差decomposition的结构主要取决于experimental\n491\t    design(多少个prompt, seed, item) 和benchmark的内在特性(知识vs推理)，而非模型能力水平。更强的模型只是 右移了accuracy分布，但各facet的相对贡献不变——prompt×item反映的是prompt\n492\t    措辞与item知识点的交互，这种交互在8B和14B上都存在且比例相似。\n493\t\n494\t    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B(reasoning distillation)在MMLU上不改变方差结构， 因为MMLU主要考察知识而非推理——reasoning\n495\t    distillation优化的是chain-of-thought 推理能力，但MMLU的MC选择不需要长推理链。R1-Distill的影响在GSM8K/MATH上\n496\t    会更显著(作为future work的motivation)。\n497\t\n498\t    cross-model model×item=22.4%(2个14B模型)仍>20%，证明model×item交互 不随scale减弱——即使是更大更强的模型，它们之间的item-level\n499\t    disagreement 仍然substantial。\n500\t\n501\t    '\n502\t  tables:\n503\t  - title: 'Supplementary Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance decomposition comparison'\n504\t    structure: Rows=variance sources; Columns=8B mean(4 models), Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-14B,\n505\t      14B mean\n506\t    highlight: 'item_id: 60.4(8B) vs 63.8/61.2(14B); hierarchy rank identical'\n507\t  figures_description:\n508\t  - 'Supplementary figure: Overlay of 8B(semi-transparent) and 14B stacked bars. Structures\n509\t    nearly identical. Annotation: \"scale does not qualitatively alter variance hierarchy.\"\n510\t\n511\t    '\n512\t  analysis: '(1) 在datacenter GPU上运行标准design(与exp-001 Llama配置一致)； (2) paired comparison:\n513\t    计算每个variance component的8B→14B delta及bootstrap CI； (3) 如果所有delta的CI含0→结论：scale是二阶调节因素。\n514\t    注意：14B需要≥48GB VRAM，可能需要tensor parallelism，这本身引入了额外的 数值非确定性(跨GPU通信的reduce顺序不同)，需要作为limitation讨论。\n515\t\n516\t    '\n517\t- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa-large)\n518\t  plan_id: exp-006\n519\t  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA: 6 seeds × 3 learning rates ×\n520\t    4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 total\n521\t    fine-tuning runs. 测试inference vs fine-tuning的方差层级是否存在质变。\n522\t\n523\t    '\n524\t  expected_results:\n525\t    total_fine_tuning_runs: 1728\n526\t    runs_per_task: 432\n527\t    ft_seed_x_lr_pct: 28.4\n528\t    ft_item_id_pct: 31.7\n529\t    ft_data_shuffle_x_item_pct: 12.3\n530\t    ft_lr_main_pct: 8.9\n531\t    ft_seed_main_pct: 6.2\n532\t    ft_gpu_x_precision_pct: 0.4\n533\t    ft_residual_pct: 12.1\n534\t    ft_G_mean: 0.487\n535\t    ft_item_id_sst2: 24.8\n536\t    ft_item_id_mnli: 33.5\n537\t    ft_item_id_rte: 38.2\n538\t    ft_item_id_copa: 30.4\n539\t    ft_seed_x_lr_sst2: 32.1\n540\t    ft_seed_x_lr_mnli: 25.8\n541\t    ft_seed_x_lr_rte: 26.4\n542\t    ft_seed_x_lr_copa: 29.2\n543\t    key_finding: 'Variance hierarchy qualitatively differs: fine-tuning is seed×lr-dominated;\n544\t      inference is item-dominated'\n545\t  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning与inference方差结构的质变解释：\n546\t\n547\t    inference中方差来源仅限于evaluation-time因素——模型参数固定，变异只来自 \"如何问\"(prompt, ordering)和\"问什么\"(item)，因此item_id主导(60%+)。\n548\t\n549\t    fine-tuning引入training-time方差源，彻底改变了方差层级： (1) seed×lr=28.4%成为最大来源：random seed决定参数初始化和dropout\n550\t    mask， learning rate决定优化轨迹的aggressive程度。seed和lr的交互极强因为： 不同初始化在不同lr下可能converge到loss\n551\t    landscape的不同local minima， 产生的decision boundary在specific items上有系统性差异。 高lr+某些seed组合可能skip过optimal\n552\t    basin导致特定item类型的性能退化。\n553\t\n554\t    (2) item_id降至31.7%：fine-tuned RoBERTa在SST-2/MNLI上accuracy>90%， 大多数items被所有模型变体正确分类——item间difficulty差异被compression到\n555\t    narrow range(90-99% correct)。相比inference时60-80%的accuracy范围， fine-tuning后item间variance空间更小，因此item_id的相对占比下降。\n556\t    SST-2的item_id最低(24.8%)因为task最简单(accuracy~94%)，items间差异最小。 RTE的item_id最高(38.2%)因为task最难(accuracy~72%)，items间差异更大。\n557\t\n558\t    (3) data_shuffle×item=12.3%：training examples的呈现顺序影响哪些patterns 被\"最后学到\"(recency\n559\t    effect)。由于catastrophic forgetting，后见examples的 patterns被更好地记住——不同shuffle导致不同items受益或受损，产生item-conditional效应。\n560\t\n561\t    (4) GPU×precision=0.4%：与inference结论一致——硬件因素在fine-tuning中同样可忽略。 training过程中的gradient\n562\t    accumulation引入了额外的数值非确定性(cuDNN autotuning, nondeterministic reduction)，但binary\n563\t    scoring下这些差异仍不足以翻转大多数items。\n564\t\n565\t    inference vs fine-tuning的对比是一个独立发现：同一个evaluation framework(G-theory) 揭示了两种根本不同的方差regime——inference是\"measurement-dominated\"(item_id主导)，\n566\t    fine-tuning是\"training-dominated\"(seed×lr主导)。这意味着reproducibility recipes 必须区分这两种使用场景。\n567\t\n568\t    '\n569\t  tables:\n570\t  - title: 'Table 15: Inference vs fine-tuning variance decomposition'\n571\t    structure: Left columns=inference sources + %; Right columns=fine-tuning sources\n572\t      + %. Rows sorted by descending % within each column.\n573\t    highlight: 'inference: item_id 60.4% #1; fine-tuning: seed×lr 28.4% #1, item_id\n574\t      31.7% #2. Regime change.'\n575\t  - title: 'Supplementary Table S2: Fine-tuning variance by NLU task'\n576\t    structure: Rows=variance sources; Columns=SST-2, MNLI, RTE, COPA, Mean\n577\t    highlight: 'item_id: SST-2 24.8 (easiest) → RTE 38.2 (hardest); seed×lr inversely\n578\t      related'\n579\t  figures_description:\n580\t  - 'Figure (supplementary): Side-by-side stacked bars — inference(left, item_id=60%\n581\t    blue dominant) vs fine-tuning(right, seed×lr=28% red + item_id=32% blue co-dominant).\n582\t    Visual regime change immediately apparent. Arrow annotation: \"training-time variance\n583\t    sources emerge and compete with item selection.\"\n584\t\n585\t    '\n586\t  analysis: '(1) 432 fine-tuning runs per task: for each (seed, lr, shuffle, gpu,\n587\t    precision) combination, train RoBERTa-large for 3 epochs, evaluate on test set,\n588\t    collect item-level binary predictions； (2) G-study with facets: seed, lr, data_shuffle,\n589\t    gpu, precision, item； (3) Cross-task comparison of variance hierarchies； (4) Formal\n590\t    comparison with inference results: test whether rank-order of sources differs\n591\t    (Friedman test on component ranks, inference vs fine-tuning). 限制：仅encoder-only\n592\t    classification。decoder fine-tuning(LoRA on LLMs)需要 substantially更多compute，作为future\n593\t    work明确说明。\n594\t\n595\t    '\n596\t- name: LayerCast precision mitigation evaluation\n597\t  plan_id: exp-007\n598\t  description: '在MMLU上测试LayerCast(FP16 storage + FP32 compute)作为第4个precision level,\n599\t    量化这种mitigation策略对variance decomposition的影响。\n600\t\n601\t    '\n602\t  expected_results:\n603\t    total_new_records: 86400\n604\t    layercast_accuracy: 0.709\n605\t    layercast_vs_fp32_gap_pp: 0.3\n606\t    layercast_vs_bf16_gap_pp: 0.2\n607\t    precision_variance_reduction_pct: 65\n608\t    precision_main_before: 1.4\n609\t    precision_main_after: 0.5\n610\t    precision_x_item_before: 2.8\n611\t    precision_x_item_after: 1.0\n612\t    other_components_change: <0.3pp on all non-precision sources\n613\t    G_before: 0.618\n614\t    G_after: 0.641\n615\t    G_improvement: 0.023\n616\t  result_rationale: 'LayerCast将precision方差降低65%的机制：LayerCast的混合精度(FP16存储+FP32计算) 在计算阶段维持了与纯FP32接近的数值精度，同时享受FP16的显存优势。\n617\t    precision方差主要来自bf16/fp16/fp32之间的数值差异——LayerCast消除了 \"存储精度=计算精度\"的耦合，使其accuracy(70.9%)位于bf16(71.1%)和fp32(60.4%)\n618\t    之间但非常接近bf16，表明FP32计算成功恢复了大部分精度。\n619\t\n620\t    precision×item从2.8%→1.0%的原因：没有LayerCast时，~15个\"边界items\" (output logit差值<0.01)在不同precision下被翻转。LayerCast的FP32计算\n621\t    使这些边界items的logit更精确，约10个不再翻转——但仍有~5个items因为 FP16权重的微小量化误差(mantissa截断)而保持翻转，贡献了剩余的1.0%。\n622\t\n623\t    G从0.618→0.641提升仅0.023因为precision×item只占总方差的2.8%—— 消除大部分precision噪声只减少了分母中一个小组分，对G的提升有限。\n624\t    这证实precision是一个real但不dominant的方差来源——值得mitigate但不是 提高reproducibility的primary lever(那是增加items)。\n625\t\n626\t    '\n627\t  tables:\n628\t  - title: 'Supplementary Table S3: LayerCast impact on variance decomposition'\n629\t    structure: Rows=precision-related sources + G; Columns=3-precision (original),\n630\t      4-precision (with LayerCast), delta\n631\t    highlight: 'precision×item: 2.8→1.0 (↓64%); G: 0.618→0.641 (+0.023)'\n632\t  figures_description: []\n633\t  analysis: '(1) 在exp-001 Llama design上增加LayerCast作为第4个precision条件 (1 model × 1 prec\n634\t    × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items)； (2) 合并4个precision\n635\t    levels重新运行G-study； (3) 比较3-precision和4-precision的decomposition，isolate LayerCast的影响；\n636\t    (4) 定位LayerCast在practitioners的precision mitigation strategy中的价值。\n637\t\n638\t    '\n639\t- name: MATH benchmark — reasoning-heavy extension\n640\t  plan_id: exp-008\n641\t  description: 'MATH 200 items × 4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps\n642\t    × 4 orderings. 测试chain-of-thought密集型任务的方差结构，扩展梯度至第5个benchmark。\n643\t\n644\t    '\n645\t  expected_results:\n646\t    total_records: 460800\n647\t    single_model_item_id_pct: 22.1\n648\t    prompt_x_item_pct: 13.5\n649\t    seed_x_item_pct: 9.8\n650\t    temp_x_item_pct: 14.2\n651\t    precision_x_item_pct: 1.8\n652\t    residual_pct: 24.6\n653\t    other_and_small_interactions_pct: 14.0\n654\t    single_model_G: 0.328\n655\t    cross_model_model_x_item_pct: 24.8\n656\t    cross_model_G: 0.035\n657\t    d_study_items_G80: 1150\n658\t    extended_gradient_MMLU: 60.4\n659\t    extended_gradient_HellaSwag: 50.4\n660\t    extended_gradient_ARC: 42.1\n661\t    extended_gradient_GSM8K: 28.3\n662\t    extended_gradient_MATH: 22.1\n663\t    extended_spread_pp: 38.3\n664\t    extended_rank_correlation: 1.0\n665\t  result_rationale: 'MATH的item_id(22.1%)为全部benchmark最低的逐步解释：\n666\t\n667\t    MATH题目需要多步数学证明和推导(平均5-10步reasoning)，每一步都是一个 stochastic branching point——在T>0时，模型在每步可能选择不同的推理策略\n668\t    (代数法 vs 几何法 vs 构造法)，而策略选择对不同item的影响截然不同。 这使得temperature×item=14.2%——MMLU(2.1%)的近7倍。物理机制：\n669\t    MATH的chain-of-thought输出平均200-400 tokens，而MMLU只需选一个字母。 长输出中的sampling variance随token数累积(每个token的采样噪声叠加)，\n670\t    使temperature的影响被系统性放大。\n671\t\n672\t    prompt×item=13.5%(MMLU的4.2倍)：MATH的few-shot exemplars不仅展示 答案格式，更展示\"如何推理\"。选择代数解法的exemplars会bias模型用代数思路，\n673\t    选择图形推理的exemplars会bias模型画辅助线——不同推理策略在不同items上 效果差异巨大(代数法在方程题上强但在几何题上弱)，产生强prompt×item交互。\n674\t\n675\t    seed×item=9.8%反映了dropout和weight initialization在推理任务上的放大效应： 多步推理中，早期步骤的微小概率差异通过后续步骤被级联放大(error\n676\t    propagation)。\n677\t\n678\t    residual=24.6%高于其他benchmark因为MATH的chain-of-thought引入了大量 不可归因的随机变异——即使控制了所有设计facet，同一(model,\n679\t    precision, prompt, seed, temperature, ordering)条件下的重复运行也因autoregressive sampling的\n680\t    inherent stochasticity产生不同推理路径和不同结果。\n681\t\n682\t    G=0.328极低：当前200-item设计完全不可靠用于MATH评估。 D-study需要1150 items(MMLU的2.4倍)才达G≥0.80——这是chain-of-thought\n683\t    引入的\"推理方差代价\"，对MATH/GPQA等reasoning benchmark有直接的实践意义。\n684\t\n685\t    model×item=24.8%(4模型)——4个benchmark中最高：不同模型的数学能力profile 差异极大(Qwen3可能擅长代数但弱于几何，Gemma反之)，导致model-specific的\n686\t    item ranking在MATH上分歧最大。\n687\t\n688\t    5-benchmark梯度完美保持单调(rank corr=1.0)，spread扩至38.3pp(仍在[25,40]内)， 进一步强化核心叙事：方差结构沿knowledge→commonsense→science→arithmetic→proof\n689\t    的认知复杂度轴系统性变化。\n690\t\n691\t    '\n692\t  tables:\n693\t  - title: 'Supplementary Table S4: Extended 5-benchmark gradient'\n694\t    structure: Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K, MATH; Columns=item_id%, prompt×item%,\n695\t      temp×item%, seed×item%, G, D-study items\n696\t    highlight: 'item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3→22.1; D-study: 480→550→650→900→1150'\n697\t  figures_description:\n698\t  - 'Extended Figure 2 (5 bars): Five stacked bars MMLU→MATH. item_id wedge (blue)\n699\t    progressively shrinks. prompt×item (orange) and temp×item (red) progressively\n700\t    grow. Perfect visual gradient. MATH bar dominated by prompt×item+temp×item+residual,\n701\t    with item_id as a minority component — stark contrast to MMLU.\n702\t\n703\t    '\n704\t  analysis: '(1) MATH evaluation需要specialized parsing: chain-of-thought output中提取final\n705\t    answer， 与gold answer做数学等价判定(symbolic equivalence, not string match)； (2) 6 prompt\n706\t    templates设计为CoT strategy variants: zero-shot CoT, few-shot(algebra examples),\n707\t    few-shot(geometry examples), few-shot(mixed), step-by-step, concise； (3) 4 orderings不适用于MATH(开放生成)——替换为4组不同的few-shot\n708\t    exemplar sets； (4) G-study + D-study与其他4个benchmark用identical pipeline处理； (5) 更新跨benchmark梯度图至5个数据点，计算extended\n709\t    Spearman ρ。'\n710\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7653c71b-c80c-411e-b242-de88d6b84f6d","uuid":"21e0fafb-5ece-43e9-aabb-a0bccefa5966","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:43:57.357Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T044739/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '4-model交叉分析完全验证2-model趋势：model×item=24.1%维持为第二大方差来源（MMLU）， 跨模型G=0.065，D-study证明即使10模型G仅0.179——model×item是不可约的结构性障碍。\n  跨benchmark梯度完美单调：MMLU(60.4%)→HellaSwag(50.4%)→ARC-C(42.1%)→GSM8K(28.3%)， 秩相关=1.0，spread=32.1pp。\"方差结构本身是benchmark-conditional的\"叙事完全成立。\n  Claim 1升级为\"model-conditional item dominance is a fundamental, benchmark-modulated\n  barrier\"。 Claim 2经多硬件确认separability（hardware×methodology=0.18%<0.5%）。 Claim 3的D-study预算表跨4benchmark揭示推理型benchmark可复现性成本为知识型的1.9倍\n  （GSM8K 900 items vs MMLU 480 items）。IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距作为独立贡献。 全部9项MD防御通过。P0五实验全部按时完成。投稿AAAI，目标7.0+/10。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Full-scale 4-model MMLU precision study\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: '4 models (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Gemma-2-9B, Mistral-7B) × 3 precisions\n    (Gemma仅bf16+fp32) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU\n    items. V0 enforce_eager统一引擎消除float32混淆。核心：4模型交叉验证2模型的model×item交互。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 891200\n    models_completed: 4\n    per_model_accuracy_bf16:\n      llama: 0.711\n      gemma: 0.732\n      mistral: 0.685\n      qwen3: 0.748\n    single_model_item_id_pct_llama: 61.1\n    single_model_item_id_pct_gemma: 58.7\n    single_model_item_id_pct_mistral: 59.4\n    single_model_item_id_pct_qwen3: 62.3\n    single_model_item_id_pct_mean: 60.4\n    single_model_G_binary_mean: 0.618\n    cross_4model_item_id_pct: 36.8\n    cross_4model_model_pct: 8.3\n    cross_4model_model_x_item_pct: 24.1\n    cross_4model_precision_pct: 1.4\n    cross_4model_prompt_x_item_pct: 3.2\n    cross_4model_seed_x_item_pct: 3.1\n    cross_4model_temp_x_item_pct: 2.1\n    cross_4model_prec_x_item_pct: 1.8\n    cross_4model_ordering_x_item_pct: 0.3\n    cross_4model_infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n    cross_4model_residual_pct: 18.8\n    cross_model_G_4model: 0.065\n    d_study_10models_G: 0.179\n    d_study_items_G80_practical: 480\n    d_study_items_G80_all_random: 540\n  result_rationale: 'model×item从2模型26.2%略降至4模型24.1%：增加Mistral和Qwen3扩大了模型多样性 （Llama/Mistral=相似decoder架构，Gemma=独特norm结构，Qwen3=GQA+SwiGLU变体），\n    但4模型的averaging效应会平滑个别模型对之间的极端分歧——2模型时Llama-Gemma的 item difficulty rank disagreement被完全捕获，4模型时某些model-pair间的agreement\n    部分抵消了其他pair的disagreement，导致总model×item略低。但24.1%仍远高于任何 其他非item来源，确认model×item是系统性的而非2-model\n    noise。\n\n    单模型item_id维持55-65%因为200-item MMLU的分层抽样覆盖STEM/humanities/social/other， 学科间难度跨度大(STEM>60%错误率\n    vs social<30%)，这种异质性在任何单模型下都表现为 高item方差。Qwen3最高(62.3%)因为其accuracy最高(74.8%)，high-accuracy模型的item\n    responses更趋向两极化(更多items被稳定地答对或答错)，增大了item间方差。\n\n    跨模型G=0.065：4模型引入更多model×item来源，G从0.073(2模型)降至0.065。 D-study投影10模型G=0.179证明model×item不可通过增加模型数量来消除——\n    这是模型架构和训练数据差异导致的item difficulty系统性重排，不是采样噪声。\n\n    infra×method<0.1%(binary)：V0 enforce_eager消除了引擎混淆，二值评分下 精度差异主要影响绝对水平，不产生precision×prompt或precision×seed的交互。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 1: Single-model variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models)'\n    structure: Rows=variance sources (item_id, precision, prompt×item, seed×item,\n      temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item, residual); Columns=Llama, Gemma, Mistral,\n      Qwen3, Mean\n    highlight: 'item_id: 61.1, 58.7, 59.4, 62.3, mean=60.4%; residual: 21.6, 22.4,\n      21.9, 20.8'\n  - title: 'Table 2: Cross-model 4-way variance decomposition (binary, MMLU)'\n    structure: Rows=variance sources incl. model, model×item; Columns=% variance,\n      bootstrap 95% CI, significance\n    highlight: 'model×item: 24.1% [21.3, 27.0] p<0.001; item_id: 36.8% [33.5, 40.2];\n      model: 8.3% [5.1, 12.4]'\n  - title: 'Table 3: G-coefficient comparison — single vs cross-model'\n    structure: Rows=Llama, Gemma, Mistral, Qwen3, 2-model cross, 4-model cross; Columns=G(binary),\n      G(text), items for G≥0.80\n    highlight: 'G collapse: single mean 0.618 → 4-model cross 0.065; D-study 10-model\n      G=0.179'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 (reveal figure): Paired stacked bars. Left bar=single-model mean decomposition\n    (item_id=60.4% dominates). Right bar=4-model cross decomposition (item_id shrinks\n    to 36.8%, model×item=24.1% appears as large new wedge, model=8.3%). Annotated\n    arrows show item_id↓23.6pp and model×item emergence. G value labels (0.618→0.065)\n    at top.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '分析流程：(1) 4模型分别运行5-facet G-study(prec×prompt×seed×temp×ordering×item)，\n    确认item_id在55-65%；(2) 合并数据，model作为crossed random facet运行6-facet G-study， 使用bf16+fp32平衡子集(Gemma限制)；(3)\n    D-study投影：固定prec+temp后，items 100→2000， 绘制G曲线；(4) 与2-model结果对比。Gemma仅有bf16+fp32，跨模型分析使用2-precision平衡子集。\n\n    '\n- name: Item resampling stability test\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: '3组独立分层200-item MMLU样本(seeds 0,7,99) × Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts ×\n    3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items = 10,800 records/sample。验证item\n    dominance非抽样伪影。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 32400\n    records_per_sample: 10800\n    conditions_per_sample: 54\n    item_id_sample_seed0: 57.8\n    item_id_sample_seed7: 62.5\n    item_id_sample_seed99: 60.1\n    item_id_mean: 60.13\n    item_id_sd: 2.37\n    resampling_item_id_cv: 0.039\n    G_sample_seed0: 0.594\n    G_sample_seed7: 0.631\n    G_sample_seed99: 0.612\n    G_mean: 0.612\n    G_cv: 0.03\n    variance_rank_order_preserved: true\n    prompt_x_item_cv: 0.061\n    seed_x_item_cv: 0.073\n    residual_cv: 0.044\n  result_rationale: 'CV=0.039(远低于15%阈值)的原因：MMLU分层抽样确保每组200 items按学科比例分配 (STEM/humanities/social/other各~50题)。item\n    dominance主要源于两层异质性： (1)学科间——STEM题目系统性更难(平均accuracy ~55%)vs social science(~78%)，\n    这个学科间差异在任何分层样本中都被保留； (2)学科内——同一学科的知识点覆盖面广(abstract_algebra vs high_school_math)，\n    不同知识点的难度差异在充分大的样本(200题)中被稳定采样。\n\n    样本间波动(57.8%-62.5%)的来源：seed7恰好抽到了更多高区分度items (如advanced mathematics中的证明题和abstract\n    algebra)，这些items的accuracy 跨条件变异更大，推高item_id。seed0抽到的items difficulty分布更均匀(中等难度居多)，\n    item间差异较小，item_id略低。但这5pp的波动相对于60%的基线是trivial的。\n\n    G系数的CV(0.030)甚至低于item_id的CV，因为G是item_id的归一化函数—— 分子(signal=item variance)和分母(total\n    variance)同方向波动，比值更稳定。\n\n    所有variance sources的rank order在3组间完全一致 (item_id>>residual>prompt×item≈seed×item>其他)，\n    证明方差结构是MMLU的内在属性而非特定200-item样本的伪影。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 4: Resampling stability — variance decomposition across 3 item draws'\n    structure: Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, prec×item, residual, other; Columns=Sample\n      A(s0), B(s7), C(s99), Mean, SD, CV\n    highlight: 'item_id: 57.8/62.5/60.1, CV=0.039; rank order identical across all\n      3 samples'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Supplementary: Three stacked bars (one per sample), nearly identical structure.\n    Bootstrap 95% CIs shown as whiskers, overlapping across all samples. Dashed horizontal\n    line at sample mean for item_id.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '(1) 用3个不同random seeds对MMLU 14K items进行分层抽样(按57个subject等比例)； (2) 每组200\n    items × 54 conditions运行完整G-study； (3) 计算每个variance component的cross-sample CV和rank\n    order一致性； (4) Friedman检验确认rank order无显著差异(p>0.10)。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark cross-task replication\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '4 models × 2 precisions (BF16/FP16; Gemma用BF16/FP32) × 6 prompts ×\n    6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag.\n    核心实验：建立跨benchmark方差梯度。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 1382400\n    records_per_benchmark: 460800\n    hellaswag_single_model_item_id_pct: 50.4\n    hellaswag_prompt_x_item_pct: 5.4\n    hellaswag_seed_x_item_pct: 4.9\n    hellaswag_temp_x_item_pct: 5.2\n    hellaswag_residual_pct: 21.3\n    hellaswag_cross_model_item_id_pct: 33.2\n    hellaswag_model_x_item_pct: 21.3\n    hellaswag_model_pct: 8.7\n    hellaswag_cross_model_G: 0.058\n    hellaswag_single_model_G: 0.548\n    hellaswag_d_study_items_G80: 550\n    arc_single_model_item_id_pct: 42.1\n    arc_prompt_x_item_pct: 7.3\n    arc_seed_x_item_pct: 5.8\n    arc_temp_x_item_pct: 6.5\n    arc_model_pct: 9.8\n    arc_residual_pct: 20.5\n    arc_cross_model_item_id_pct: 27.4\n    arc_model_x_item_pct: 22.7\n    arc_cross_model_G: 0.052\n    arc_single_model_G: 0.495\n    arc_d_study_items_G80: 650\n    gsm8k_single_model_item_id_pct: 28.3\n    gsm8k_prompt_x_item_pct: 11.8\n    gsm8k_seed_x_item_pct: 8.2\n    gsm8k_temp_x_item_pct: 9.4\n    gsm8k_model_pct: 12.4\n    gsm8k_residual_pct: 18.2\n    gsm8k_cross_model_item_id_pct: 16.5\n    gsm8k_model_x_item_pct: 23.5\n    gsm8k_cross_model_G: 0.041\n    gsm8k_single_model_G: 0.385\n    gsm8k_d_study_items_G80: 900\n    gradient_item_id_MMLU: 60.4\n    gradient_item_id_HellaSwag: 50.4\n    gradient_item_id_ARC: 42.1\n    gradient_item_id_GSM8K: 28.3\n    gradient_spread_pp: 32.1\n    gradient_rank_correlation: 1.0\n    model_x_item_range: 21.3-24.1% across all benchmarks\n    cross_model_G_range: 0.041-0.065 across all benchmarks\n    separability_binary_all_lt_0_5pct: true\n  result_rationale: '跨benchmark梯度单调递减的逐级机制解释：\n\n    MMLU(知识检索, item_id=60.4%): 题目考察封闭式事实(如\"RNA聚合酶的功能\")。 item difficulty取决于知识点的稀有程度和训练数据覆盖，这对同一模型的不同\n    prompt/seed/temperature非常稳定——模型要么在训练语料中见过这个fact，要么没有。 改变prompt措辞(\"Answer the following\"→\"Select\n    the correct option\")不会让模型 突然\"知道\"之前不知道的知识。temperature的影响也小——T=0.0和T=0.3下， 知识检索的top\n    token概率通常>0.9，sampling几乎不改变结果。因此item_id占主导60%+。\n\n    HellaSwag(常识推理, item_id=50.4%, ↓10pp): 题目要求基于日常场景选择合理的continuation。 item difficulty仍有较强结构(某些场景本质上更容易判断，如\"厨师拿起刀→开始切菜\"\n    vs 模糊场景)，但prompt措辞开始影响模型对场景的\"理解角度\"——不同prompt可能 引导模型关注不同的context cue，导致prompt×item从MMLU的3.2%升至5.4%。\n    temperature的影响也增大(5.2% vs 2.1%)因为常识推理的答案概率分布更平坦(top token 概率~0.6-0.8)，sampling噪声有更大机会翻转结果。\n\n    ARC-Challenge(科学推理, item_id=42.1%, ↓8pp): 题目需要多步科学推理 (如\"如果地球轴倾斜增大，对季节有什么影响→更极端\")。推理路径的选择更依赖\n    prompt引导——few-shot示例的推理风格会bias模型的reasoning approach， prompt×item升至7.3%。seed×item=5.8%反映了多步推理中采样分支点的影响。\n    model间的科学推理能力差异更显著(model=9.8% vs MMLU 8.3%)—— 有些模型(Qwen3)在STEM训练上投入更多，而有些(Mistral)偏向语言任务。\n\n    GSM8K(数学推理, item_id=28.3%, ↓14pp): 多步算术(平均4-6步)使每一步成为随机分支点。 temperature直接控制chain-of-thought的随机性(temp×item=9.4%,\n    MMLU的4.5倍)—— T=0.7时同一题可能生成完全不同的解题路径，有的正确有的错误。 prompt格式影响极大(prompt×item=11.8%)：few-shot示例中的解题格式\n    (\"Let''s think step by step\" vs \"Solution:\" vs 无CoT)直接决定模型是否使用 chain-of-thought，对不同难度的item影响截然不同——简单加减题不需要CoT也能对，\n    但复杂分数题没有CoT就会失败。seed×item=8.2%因为多步生成过程中的 cumulative sampling variance在长输出中被放大。\n\n    model×item在所有benchmark维持20-24%的原因：不同模型的训练数据和架构差异 导致model-specific的知识和能力profile——Qwen3可能在数学上强但常识弱，\n    Gemma可能科学推理强但数学弱。这种model-specific的item ranking在所有task type上 都产生显著交互，而且不随benchmark类型系统性变化——它是模型多样性的反映而非\n    task type的函数。\n\n    D-study预算梯度(MMLU 480→GSM8K 900 items)的解释： 推理型benchmark的非item方差(prompt×item + temp×item\n    + seed×item)合计 从MMLU的~9%增至GSM8K的~29%。要在这些额外噪声源存在的情况下仍达到G≥0.80， 需要更多items来提高signal-to-noise\n    ratio。GSM8K需要近2倍于MMLU的items， 揭示\"推理型benchmark的可复现性成本远高于知识型\"——这是一个有直接实践意义的发现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 5: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary)'\n    structure: Rows=item_id, prompt×item, seed×item, temp×item, prec×item, ordering×item,\n      residual, other; Columns=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K\n    highlight: 'item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3 (monotonic ↓); prompt×item: 3.2→5.4→7.3→11.8\n      (monotonic ↑); temp×item: 2.1→5.2→6.5→9.4 (monotonic ↑)'\n  - title: 'Table 6: Cross-model (4-model) decomposition per benchmark'\n    structure: Rows=benchmark; Columns=item_id%, model%, model×item%, cross-model\n      G, D-study items G≥0.80\n    highlight: 'model×item: MMLU 24.1, HellaSwag 21.3, ARC 22.7, GSM8K 23.5 — all\n      ≥20%'\n  - title: 'Table 7: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budgets'\n    structure: Rows=benchmark; Columns=items(practical), prompts, seeds, total conditions,\n      est. GPU-hours per model\n    highlight: 'MMLU: 480 items × 3 prompts × 4 seeds; GSM8K: 900 items × 4 prompts\n      × 6 seeds'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2 (gradient figure, core novel finding): Four stacked bars arranged MMLU→HellaSwag→ARC→GSM8K.\n    item_id wedge visually shrinks left→right (blue). prompt×item (orange) and temp×item\n    (red) wedges grow. Monotonic gradient immediately visible. Bracket annotations\n    show spread=32.1pp. Spearman ρ=1.0 labeled.\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 3 (D-study budget comparison): Four D-study curves (G vs items), one per\n    benchmark. MMLU reaches G=0.80 first (~480 items), GSM8K last (~900 items). Horizontal\n    dashed lines at G=0.70 and G=0.80. Shaded region below G=0.80 labeled \"unreliable\n    zone.\" Inset shows current practice (200 items) falls below 0.80 for all benchmarks.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '(1) 每个benchmark的6 prompt templates需要benchmark-specific设计(GSM8K用CoT variants,\n    ARC用science reasoning templates, HellaSwag用completion templates)； (2) 4 ordering\n    rotations: ABCD→BCDA→CDAB→DABC for MC benchmarks; GSM8K无ordering facet (开放式生成)，用4个不同的few-shot\n    exemplar sets替代； (3) 分别对每个benchmark运行single-model和4-model G-study； (4) 计算跨benchmark\n    Spearman ρ(item_id排序 vs 先验reasoning complexity排序)； (5) 对每个benchmark运行D-study grid\n    search(items×prompts×seeds)找G≥0.80最优配置。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-hardware separability G-study\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '4 models × 2 GPU types × 2 precisions (BF16, FP16/FP32) × 6 prompts\n    × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items. Claim 2核心实验： 测试hardware×methodology交互，证明基础设施和方法论因素可分离。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_analyzed: 1382400\n    new_records_gpu2: 691200\n    gpu_types:\n    - RTX PRO 6000 (Blackwell)\n    - TBD second GPU\n    gpu_type_main_effect_pct: 0.12\n    hardware_x_methodology_binary_pct: 0.18\n    hardware_x_prompt_pct: 0.05\n    hardware_x_seed_pct: 0.02\n    hardware_x_temperature_binary_pct: 0.04\n    hardware_x_ordering_pct: 0.07\n    hardware_x_item_pct: 1.2\n    precision_x_hardware_pct: 0.35\n    hardware_x_temperature_text_pct: 0.83\n    separability_confirmed_binary: true\n    item_id_with_hardware: 59.8\n    variance_structure_consistent_with_exp001: true\n  result_rationale: 'hardware×methodology=0.18%(binary)的物理解释：两种GPU微架构(如Blackwell vs\n    Ampere) 的浮点运算单元实现不同——Tensor Core的矩阵乘法顺序、warp-level reduction的 累加顺序都不同。但在BF16/FP16下，这些数值差异只影响最后1-2\n    bits of mantissa。 对于binary scoring，一个item的正确/错误判定取决于top token概率是否最高—— 只有当两个选项的概率差<0.001时，GPU差异才可能翻转结果。这种\"边界item\"在200题中\n    约3-5题，且它们与prompt/seed的交互在统计上不可与noise区分，因此 hardware×prompt和hardware×seed都<0.1%。\n\n    hardware×item=1.2%高于hardware×methodology的原因：这1.2%来自那些确实被 GPU差异翻转的边界items——它们的翻转是item-specific的(取决于item的概率分布形状)，\n    而非methodology-specific的。这是item-conditional的hardware效应， 不违反separability——separability关注的是hardware是否调节methodology的效应，\n    而hardware×item只说明hardware的效应是item-dependent的(符合预期)。\n\n    text_exact_match下hardware×temperature=0.83%：文本精确匹配对生成过程中的 任何微小概率差异都敏感(不同token选择→不同字符串→match失败)。\n    temperature放大了GPU数值差异的影响——T=0.7时sampling distribution更平坦， GPU间mantissa差异更有可能改变sampled\n    token。但0.83%仍<1%， 与Messina & Scotta (2026)的FP非结合性理论预测量级一致。\n\n    整体方差结构与exp-001一致(item_id=59.8% vs 60.4%)， hardware facet仅\"吸收\"了0.6pp的原属residual的方差，\n    证明单GPU实验的结论不因hardware选择而改变。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 8: Hardware-crossed variance decomposition (binary, MMLU, 4 models\n      × 2 GPUs)'\n    structure: Rows=all sources including 6 hardware interaction terms; Columns=%\n      variance, 95% CI, significant?\n    highlight: 'hardware: 0.12% [0.02,0.31]; hw×method(aggregate): 0.18% [0.03,0.42];\n      hw×item: 1.2% [0.7,1.8]'\n  - title: 'Table 9: Metric-conditional separability test'\n    structure: Rows=hardware interaction terms; Columns=binary %, text_exact_match\n      %, difference\n    highlight: 'hw×temp: binary 0.04% vs text 0.83%; separability is metric-conditional'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Supplementary: Heatmap of all infrastructure×methodology interaction terms (rows=infra\n    factors, cols=method factors). Binary panel: all cells <0.5% (cool colors). Text\n    panel: hw×temp cell at 0.83% (warm spot). Diagonal of hardware×item shown separately\n    at 1.2%.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '(1) 在第2种GPU上运行与exp-001匹配的设计(4模型 × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps\n    × 4 orderings)； (2) 合并两GPU数据，hardware作为crossed facet运行G-study； (3) 分别提取所有hardware×methodology和hardware×item交互项；\n    (4) binary和text_exact_match分别分析； (5) bootstrap CI检验每个hardware交互项是否显著异于0。\n\n    '\n- name: Comprehensive combined analysis\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: '对exp-001/001b/002/003的全部数据进行17项系统分析(a-q)。纯分析实验(0 GPU hours)。 涵盖model-as-facet、bootstrap\n    CIs、IRT对比、全部9项MD防御、power analysis、 practitioner toolkit生成。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_analyzed: 4288000\n    bootstrap_resamples: 1000\n    ci_model_x_item_95:\n    - 21.3\n    - 27.0\n    ci_item_id_95:\n    - 33.5\n    - 40.2\n    ci_cross_model_G_95:\n    - 0.048\n    - 0.083\n    all_key_cis_exclude_zero: true\n    d_study_items_G80_practical_ci:\n    - 445\n    - 520\n    d_study_items_G80_all_random_ci:\n    - 495\n    - 590\n    reml_vs_henderson_max_diff_pct: 1.4\n    reml_vs_henderson_rank_preserved: true\n    logprob_item_id_pct_mmlu: 53.2\n    logprob_G_mmlu: 0.572\n    logprob_vs_binary_rank_correlation: 0.94\n    precision_x_temp_alters_model_ranking: false\n    kendall_tau_across_conditions: 0.94\n    higher_order_total_pct: 3.2\n    largest_3way: prec×temp×item = 1.1%\n    irt_mmlu_items: 116\n    gtheory_mmlu_items: 510\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_mmlu: 4.4\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_hellaswag: 4.2\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_arc: 4.35\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_gsm8k: 4.65\n    irt_gtheory_ratio_mean: 4.4\n    gtheory_G_at_irt_recommendation: 0.529\n    power_5pct_interaction: 0.998\n    min_detectable_interaction_80pct_power: 1.2\n    fixed_vs_random_item_id_change_pct: 2.8\n    fixed_vs_random_G_change: 0.032\n    bernoulli_observed_correlation: 0.68\n    null_simulation_item_id_pct: 0.09\n    observed_over_null_ratio: 671\n    bootstrap_jackknife_ci_width_ratio_range:\n    - 0.96\n    - 1.04\n    mmlu_2x2_vs_3x3_item_id_diff_pct: 3.6\n    g_at_14k_mmlu_items: 0.943\n    logprob_item_id_gradient: MMLU 53.2→HellaSwag 44.1→ARC 37.8→GSM8K 24.6\n    gpu_hours_mmlu_G80_per_model: 48\n    gpu_hours_gsm8k_G80_per_model: 135\n    recommended_min_prompts: 3\n    recommended_min_seeds: 4\n    recommended_temperature: 0.0\n    recommended_min_items_knowledge: 480\n    recommended_min_items_reasoning: 900\n  result_rationale: 'IRT vs G-theory 4.4×差距的机制： IRT(Rasch/2PL)将response建模为θ_person和b_item的函数，所有非item因素\n    (prompt, seed, ordering)被折入error term。因此IRT的\"reliable measurement\" 只要求item difficulty参数估计稳定——116\n    items足以稳定估计200个difficulty参数 (Rasch的渐近效率在~100 items时充分)。 G-theory将prompt×item(4.6%),\n    seed×item(4.7%), ordering×item等作为系统性方差分离出来， G系数的分母包含这些维度的方差。要在同时考虑prompt/seed/ordering变异的情况下\n    仍达到G≥0.80，需要510 items——额外的394 items用于\"吸收\"IRT忽略的非item噪声。 在IRT推荐的116 items处，G-theory\n    G仅0.529——这就是\"多facet reliability的代价\"。\n\n    GSM8K的ratio(4.65×)高于MMLU(4.40×)因为数学任务的prompt/seed/temperature方差更大， G-theory需要吸收的额外噪声更多，而IRT仍只看item\n    discrimination(GSM8K items的 discrimination通常更高——数学题更能区分能力，因此IRT需要的items反而更少)。\n\n    bootstrap CI [21.3, 27.0] on model×item不含0的原因：4模型×200 items的设计 每个model×item cell有864个重复(6\n    prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 2 prec × 2 GPU)， power分析显示对≥1.2% interaction\n    effect的检测power>0.80， 对≥5% effect的power>0.998。24.1%的效应量远超检测阈值。\n\n    fixed vs random sensitivity仅2.8%变化(MD2)：temperature虽只有3个设计点， 但在G-theory中fixed/random的区别仅影响temperature方差是否进入G系数分母。\n    temperature main effect<2%，fixed→random只增加分母~2%→item_id%变化2.8%。 这证明即使temperature不满足\"从universe随机抽样\"的理想假设，结论仍稳健。\n\n    binary data defense(MD1): r(Bernoulli p(1-p), observed)=0.68表明~46%的item variance可归因于Bernoulli机制(difficulty\n    p决定p(1-p))，但null simulation (random p_i ~ Uniform, item_id=0.09%)证明仅Bernoulli机制不产生我们观察到的\n    61%方差——实际值是null的671倍。另外54%的\"超Bernoulli\"item variance反映了 items间真实的知识点差异和cognitive\n    demand差异。\n\n    G at 14K items=0.943(MD5)：D-study投影f(n_items)是log-concave的， 200→14K items的G提升(0.618→0.943)证明完整MMLU的reliability远高于\n    200-item子集。我们的发现是\"子抽样的成本\"而非\"MMLU本身不可靠\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 10: IRT vs G-theory item requirements (4 benchmarks)'\n    structure: Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=IRT items, G-theory items,\n      ratio, G-theory G at IRT items, extra sources\n    highlight: 'MMLU: 116 vs 510 (4.4×), G=0.529 at 116; GSM8K: 82 vs 381 (4.65×)'\n  - title: 'Table 11: Bootstrap 95% CIs on variance components (MMLU, 4-model cross)'\n    structure: Rows=all variance sources; Columns=point %, lower CI, upper CI, excludes\n      0?\n    highlight: model×item [21.3,27.0] excludes 0 ✓; infra×method [0.0,0.42] includes\n      0 ✓\n  - title: 'Table 12: Methodological defense summary (MD1-MD9)'\n    structure: Rows=MD1 binary data through MD9 title alignment; Columns=test, threshold,\n      result, verdict\n    highlight: 'All 9 defenses pass: MD1 671× null, MD2 <5% change, MD3 qualified,\n      MD4 monotonic, MD5 0.943, MD6 ratio 0.96-1.04, MD7 4.4× ratio, MD8 <5% change,\n      MD9 logprob expanded'\n  - title: 'Table 13: Benchmark-specific D-study reproducibility budget (G≥0.80)'\n    structure: Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K; Columns=items, prompts, seeds,\n      total conditions, est. GPU-hours, comparison to current practice\n    highlight: MMLU 480×3×4, GSM8K 900×4×6; current practice (200×1×1) yields G=0.385-0.618\n  - title: 'Table 14: GPU cost estimates for recommended budgets'\n    structure: Rows=benchmark; Columns=items, prompts, seeds, hours/model (8B), hours/model\n      (14B)\n    highlight: MMLU ~48h, GSM8K ~135h (8B model on single GPU)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4 (IRT vs G-theory): Stacked bar pair per benchmark. Left bar (IRT, narrow):\n    116 items single color. Right bar (G-theory, wide): 510 items stacked—base 116\n    items (same color as IRT), extra items partitioned into prompt×item portion (orange),\n    seed×item portion (green), residual portion (gray). Visual immediately shows \"where\n    the extra items go.\"\n\n    '\n  - 'Figure 5 (temperature×metric heatmap): 2 rows (binary, text_exact_match) × 3\n    columns (T=0.0, T=0.3, T=0.7). Cell color=G value. Binary row: gradual degradation\n    0.760→0.624→0.549. Text row: 0.058→0.011→0.007 (near-zero across all T>0). Stark\n    contrast between rows.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '17项分析按依赖关系分3波执行： Wave 1 (独立，可并行): bootstrap CIs(b), jackknife CIs(m),\n    fixed/random(k), binary defense(l), REML vs Henderson(d), 2×2 vs 3×3(n), power(i),\n    logprob(e,p). Wave 2 (需Wave 1 CIs): model-as-facet final(a), D-study with CIs(c),\n    higher-order(g), ranking stability(f). Wave 3 (需全部benchmark数据): IRT comparison(h),\n    cross-benchmark budget(j,q), G@14K(o), practitioner protocol(j).\n\n    '\n- name: 14B model scale extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Qwen3-14B和DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B在datacenter GPU上运行BF16/FP16 × MMLU\n    200 items。 测试模型规模(8B→14B)和架构(dense vs reasoning-distilled)对方差层级的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 345600\n    qwen3_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.792\n    deepseek_r1_14b_accuracy_bf16: 0.803\n    qwen3_14b_item_id_pct: 63.8\n    deepseek_r1_14b_item_id_pct: 61.2\n    scale_14b_item_id_mean: 62.5\n    scale_8b_item_id_mean: 60.4\n    scale_delta_pp: 2.1\n    scale_delta_significant: false\n    single_model_G_14b_mean: 0.642\n    cross_model_2x14b_model_x_item_pct: 22.4\n    variance_hierarchy_preserved: true\n    prompt_x_item_14b_mean: 3.8\n    seed_x_item_14b_mean: 4.1\n    residual_14b_mean: 19.5\n  result_rationale: '14B模型item_id略高于8B(62.5% vs 60.4%, +2.1pp，不显著)的原因： 14B模型的知识覆盖更广(训练参数多50-75%)，使得item\n    difficulty的\"已知/未知\" 二分更加清晰——更多items被稳定答对(高置信度)或仍然稳定答错(超出能力范围)， item间的正确率差异(variance)更大。但增幅很小因为MMLU的difficulty分布跨度大，\n    即使14B模型也在高难度STEM题上系统性失败(如abstract_algebra正确率<30%)。\n\n    方差层级完全保持(item_id>>prompt×item≈seed×item>residual>其他)的原因： 方差decomposition的结构主要取决于experimental\n    design(多少个prompt, seed, item) 和benchmark的内在特性(知识vs推理)，而非模型能力水平。更强的模型只是 右移了accuracy分布，但各facet的相对贡献不变——prompt×item反映的是prompt\n    措辞与item知识点的交互，这种交互在8B和14B上都存在且比例相似。\n\n    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B(reasoning distillation)在MMLU上不改变方差结构， 因为MMLU主要考察知识而非推理——reasoning\n    distillation优化的是chain-of-thought 推理能力，但MMLU的MC选择不需要长推理链。R1-Distill的影响在GSM8K/MATH上\n    会更显著(作为future work的motivation)。\n\n    cross-model model×item=22.4%(2个14B模型)仍>20%，证明model×item交互 不随scale减弱——即使是更大更强的模型，它们之间的item-level\n    disagreement 仍然substantial。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Supplementary Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance decomposition comparison'\n    structure: Rows=variance sources; Columns=8B mean(4 models), Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-14B,\n      14B mean\n    highlight: 'item_id: 60.4(8B) vs 63.8/61.2(14B); hierarchy rank identical'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Supplementary figure: Overlay of 8B(semi-transparent) and 14B stacked bars. Structures\n    nearly identical. Annotation: \"scale does not qualitatively alter variance hierarchy.\"\n\n    '\n  analysis: '(1) 在datacenter GPU上运行标准design(与exp-001 Llama配置一致)； (2) paired comparison:\n    计算每个variance component的8B→14B delta及bootstrap CI； (3) 如果所有delta的CI含0→结论：scale是二阶调节因素。\n    注意：14B需要≥48GB VRAM，可能需要tensor parallelism，这本身引入了额外的 数值非确定性(跨GPU通信的reduce顺序不同)，需要作为limitation讨论。\n\n    '\n- name: Fine-tuning G-study (RoBERTa-large)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 'RoBERTa-large on SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA: 6 seeds × 3 learning rates ×\n    4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1,728 total\n    fine-tuning runs. 测试inference vs fine-tuning的方差层级是否存在质变。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_fine_tuning_runs: 1728\n    runs_per_task: 432\n    ft_seed_x_lr_pct: 28.4\n    ft_item_id_pct: 31.7\n    ft_data_shuffle_x_item_pct: 12.3\n    ft_lr_main_pct: 8.9\n    ft_seed_main_pct: 6.2\n    ft_gpu_x_precision_pct: 0.4\n    ft_residual_pct: 12.1\n    ft_G_mean: 0.487\n    ft_item_id_sst2: 24.8\n    ft_item_id_mnli: 33.5\n    ft_item_id_rte: 38.2\n    ft_item_id_copa: 30.4\n    ft_seed_x_lr_sst2: 32.1\n    ft_seed_x_lr_mnli: 25.8\n    ft_seed_x_lr_rte: 26.4\n    ft_seed_x_lr_copa: 29.2\n    key_finding: 'Variance hierarchy qualitatively differs: fine-tuning is seed×lr-dominated;\n      inference is item-dominated'\n  result_rationale: 'Fine-tuning与inference方差结构的质变解释：\n\n    inference中方差来源仅限于evaluation-time因素——模型参数固定，变异只来自 \"如何问\"(prompt, ordering)和\"问什么\"(item)，因此item_id主导(60%+)。\n\n    fine-tuning引入training-time方差源，彻底改变了方差层级： (1) seed×lr=28.4%成为最大来源：random seed决定参数初始化和dropout\n    mask， learning rate决定优化轨迹的aggressive程度。seed和lr的交互极强因为： 不同初始化在不同lr下可能converge到loss\n    landscape的不同local minima， 产生的decision boundary在specific items上有系统性差异。 高lr+某些seed组合可能skip过optimal\n    basin导致特定item类型的性能退化。\n\n    (2) item_id降至31.7%：fine-tuned RoBERTa在SST-2/MNLI上accuracy>90%， 大多数items被所有模型变体正确分类——item间difficulty差异被compression到\n    narrow range(90-99% correct)。相比inference时60-80%的accuracy范围， fine-tuning后item间variance空间更小，因此item_id的相对占比下降。\n    SST-2的item_id最低(24.8%)因为task最简单(accuracy~94%)，items间差异最小。 RTE的item_id最高(38.2%)因为task最难(accuracy~72%)，items间差异更大。\n\n    (3) data_shuffle×item=12.3%：training examples的呈现顺序影响哪些patterns 被\"最后学到\"(recency\n    effect)。由于catastrophic forgetting，后见examples的 patterns被更好地记住——不同shuffle导致不同items受益或受损，产生item-conditional效应。\n\n    (4) GPU×precision=0.4%：与inference结论一致——硬件因素在fine-tuning中同样可忽略。 training过程中的gradient\n    accumulation引入了额外的数值非确定性(cuDNN autotuning, nondeterministic reduction)，但binary\n    scoring下这些差异仍不足以翻转大多数items。\n\n    inference vs fine-tuning的对比是一个独立发现：同一个evaluation framework(G-theory) 揭示了两种根本不同的方差regime——inference是\"measurement-dominated\"(item_id主导)，\n    fine-tuning是\"training-dominated\"(seed×lr主导)。这意味着reproducibility recipes 必须区分这两种使用场景。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 15: Inference vs fine-tuning variance decomposition'\n    structure: Left columns=inference sources + %; Right columns=fine-tuning sources\n      + %. Rows sorted by descending % within each column.\n    highlight: 'inference: item_id 60.4% #1; fine-tuning: seed×lr 28.4% #1, item_id\n      31.7% #2. Regime change.'\n  - title: 'Supplementary Table S2: Fine-tuning variance by NLU task'\n    structure: Rows=variance sources; Columns=SST-2, MNLI, RTE, COPA, Mean\n    highlight: 'item_id: SST-2 24.8 (easiest) → RTE 38.2 (hardest); seed×lr inversely\n      related'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure (supplementary): Side-by-side stacked bars — inference(left, item_id=60%\n    blue dominant) vs fine-tuning(right, seed×lr=28% red + item_id=32% blue co-dominant).\n    Visual regime change immediately apparent. Arrow annotation: \"training-time variance\n    sources emerge and compete with item selection.\"\n\n    '\n  analysis: '(1) 432 fine-tuning runs per task: for each (seed, lr, shuffle, gpu,\n    precision) combination, train RoBERTa-large for 3 epochs, evaluate on test set,\n    collect item-level binary predictions； (2) G-study with facets: seed, lr, data_shuffle,\n    gpu, precision, item； (3) Cross-task comparison of variance hierarchies； (4) Formal\n    comparison with inference results: test whether rank-order of sources differs\n    (Friedman test on component ranks, inference vs fine-tuning). 限制：仅encoder-only\n    classification。decoder fine-tuning(LoRA on LLMs)需要 substantially更多compute，作为future\n    work明确说明。\n\n    '\n- name: LayerCast precision mitigation evaluation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: '在MMLU上测试LayerCast(FP16 storage + FP32 compute)作为第4个precision level,\n    量化这种mitigation策略对variance decomposition的影响。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_new_records: 86400\n    layercast_accuracy: 0.709\n    layercast_vs_fp32_gap_pp: 0.3\n    layercast_vs_bf16_gap_pp: 0.2\n    precision_variance_reduction_pct: 65\n    precision_main_before: 1.4\n    precision_main_after: 0.5\n    precision_x_item_before: 2.8\n    precision_x_item_after: 1.0\n    other_components_change: <0.3pp on all non-precision sources\n    G_before: 0.618\n    G_after: 0.641\n    G_improvement: 0.023\n  result_rationale: 'LayerCast将precision方差降低65%的机制：LayerCast的混合精度(FP16存储+FP32计算) 在计算阶段维持了与纯FP32接近的数值精度，同时享受FP16的显存优势。\n    precision方差主要来自bf16/fp16/fp32之间的数值差异——LayerCast消除了 \"存储精度=计算精度\"的耦合，使其accuracy(70.9%)位于bf16(71.1%)和fp32(60.4%)\n    之间但非常接近bf16，表明FP32计算成功恢复了大部分精度。\n\n    precision×item从2.8%→1.0%的原因：没有LayerCast时，~15个\"边界items\" (output logit差值<0.01)在不同precision下被翻转。LayerCast的FP32计算\n    使这些边界items的logit更精确，约10个不再翻转——但仍有~5个items因为 FP16权重的微小量化误差(mantissa截断)而保持翻转，贡献了剩余的1.0%。\n\n    G从0.618→0.641提升仅0.023因为precision×item只占总方差的2.8%—— 消除大部分precision噪声只减少了分母中一个小组分，对G的提升有限。\n    这证实precision是一个real但不dominant的方差来源——值得mitigate但不是 提高reproducibility的primary lever(那是增加items)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Supplementary Table S3: LayerCast impact on variance decomposition'\n    structure: Rows=precision-related sources + G; Columns=3-precision (original),\n      4-precision (with LayerCast), delta\n    highlight: 'precision×item: 2.8→1.0 (↓64%); G: 0.618→0.641 (+0.023)'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '(1) 在exp-001 Llama design上增加LayerCast作为第4个precision条件 (1 model × 1 prec\n    × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items)； (2) 合并4个precision\n    levels重新运行G-study； (3) 比较3-precision和4-precision的decomposition，isolate LayerCast的影响；\n    (4) 定位LayerCast在practitioners的precision mitigation strategy中的价值。\n\n    '\n- name: MATH benchmark — reasoning-heavy extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 'MATH 200 items × 4 models × 2 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps\n    × 4 orderings. 测试chain-of-thought密集型任务的方差结构，扩展梯度至第5个benchmark。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 460800\n    single_model_item_id_pct: 22.1\n    prompt_x_item_pct: 13.5\n    seed_x_item_pct: 9.8\n    temp_x_item_pct: 14.2\n    precision_x_item_pct: 1.8\n    residual_pct: 24.6\n    other_and_small_interactions_pct: 14.0\n    single_model_G: 0.328\n    cross_model_model_x_item_pct: 24.8\n    cross_model_G: 0.035\n    d_study_items_G80: 1150\n    extended_gradient_MMLU: 60.4\n    extended_gradient_HellaSwag: 50.4\n    extended_gradient_ARC: 42.1\n    extended_gradient_GSM8K: 28.3\n    extended_gradient_MATH: 22.1\n    extended_spread_pp: 38.3\n    extended_rank_correlation: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'MATH的item_id(22.1%)为全部benchmark最低的逐步解释：\n\n    MATH题目需要多步数学证明和推导(平均5-10步reasoning)，每一步都是一个 stochastic branching point——在T>0时，模型在每步可能选择不同的推理策略\n    (代数法 vs 几何法 vs 构造法)，而策略选择对不同item的影响截然不同。 这使得temperature×item=14.2%——MMLU(2.1%)的近7倍。物理机制：\n    MATH的chain-of-thought输出平均200-400 tokens，而MMLU只需选一个字母。 长输出中的sampling variance随token数累积(每个token的采样噪声叠加)，\n    使temperature的影响被系统性放大。\n\n    prompt×item=13.5%(MMLU的4.2倍)：MATH的few-shot exemplars不仅展示 答案格式，更展示\"如何推理\"。选择代数解法的exemplars会bias模型用代数思路，\n    选择图形推理的exemplars会bias模型画辅助线——不同推理策略在不同items上 效果差异巨大(代数法在方程题上强但在几何题上弱)，产生强prompt×item交互。\n\n    seed×item=9.8%反映了dropout和weight initialization在推理任务上的放大效应： 多步推理中，早期步骤的微小概率差异通过后续步骤被级联放大(error\n    propagation)。\n\n    residual=24.6%高于其他benchmark因为MATH的chain-of-thought引入了大量 不可归因的随机变异——即使控制了所有设计facet，同一(model,\n    precision, prompt, seed, temperature, ordering)条件下的重复运行也因autoregressive sampling的\n    inherent stochasticity产生不同推理路径和不同结果。\n\n    G=0.328极低：当前200-item设计完全不可靠用于MATH评估。 D-study需要1150 items(MMLU的2.4倍)才达G≥0.80——这是chain-of-thought\n    引入的\"推理方差代价\"，对MATH/GPQA等reasoning benchmark有直接的实践意义。\n\n    model×item=24.8%(4模型)——4个benchmark中最高：不同模型的数学能力profile 差异极大(Qwen3可能擅长代数但弱于几何，Gemma反之)，导致model-specific的\n    item ranking在MATH上分歧最大。\n\n    5-benchmark梯度完美保持单调(rank corr=1.0)，spread扩至38.3pp(仍在[25,40]内)， 进一步强化核心叙事：方差结构沿knowledge→commonsense→science→arithmetic→proof\n    的认知复杂度轴系统性变化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Supplementary Table S4: Extended 5-benchmark gradient'\n    structure: Rows=MMLU, HellaSwag, ARC-C, GSM8K, MATH; Columns=item_id%, prompt×item%,\n      temp×item%, seed×item%, G, D-study items\n    highlight: 'item_id: 60.4→50.4→42.1→28.3→22.1; D-study: 480→550→650→900→1150'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Extended Figure 2 (5 bars): Five stacked bars MMLU→MATH. item_id wedge (blue)\n    progressively shrinks. prompt×item (orange) and temp×item (red) progressively\n    grow. Perfect visual gradient. MATH bar dominated by prompt×item+temp×item+residual,\n    with item_id as a minority component — stark contrast to MMLU.\n\n    '\n  analysis: '(1) MATH evaluation需要specialized parsing: chain-of-thought output中提取final\n    answer， 与gold answer做数学等价判定(symbolic equivalence, not string match)； (2) 6 prompt\n    templates设计为CoT strategy variants: zero-shot CoT, few-shot(algebra examples),\n    few-shot(geometry examples), few-shot(mixed), step-by-step, concise； (3) 4 orderings不适用于MATH(开放生成)——替换为4组不同的few-shot\n    exemplar sets； (4) G-study + D-study与其他4个benchmark用identical pipeline处理； (5) 更新跨benchmark梯度图至5个数据点，计算extended\n    Spearman ρ。'\n","numLines":710,"startLine":1,"totalLines":710}}}
