{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013PMBJbyRdcnq1vFj3cSyDy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"AAAI 2026 reviewer guidelines scoring criteria scale\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Main Technical Track: Call for Papers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/main-technical-track-call/\"},{\"title\":\"Overview of the AI Review System\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"ReviewerToo: Should AI Join The Program Committee? A Look At The Future of Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2510.08867v1\"},{\"title\":\"AI-Assisted Peer Review at Scale: The AAAI-26 AI Review Pilot\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.13940v1\"},{\"title\":\"Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\"},{\"title\":\"Grant Peer Review: Improving Inter-Rater Reliability with Training\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4468126/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about AAAI 2026's review process and criteria, though the specific scoring scale details were not fully detailed in the retrieved documents.\n\nAll submissions to AAAI 2026 will be evaluated and scored for the significance and novelty of the contributions, theoretical and/or empirical soundness of the claims, their relevance to the AAAI community, and clarity of exposition.\n\nEvery paper will be allocated three reviewers in Phase 1, and if a paper receives sufficiently negative reviews, it will be rejected without any opportunity for author feedback, while remaining papers will progress to Phase 2.\n\nThe search results reference that more detailed information about reviewer guidelines is available on the \"AAAI 2026 Reviewer Instructions\" page, but the specific scoring scale (such as numerical values or rating categories) was not included in these search results. For the complete and detailed scoring criteria scale, you may want to visit the official AAAI 2026 reviewer instructions page directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7653c71b-c80c-411e-b242-de88d6b84f6d","uuid":"08cb9890-012d-46c8-b3d4-a54500f027df","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:44:15.474Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"AAAI 2026 reviewer guidelines scoring criteria scale","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01DHtVqxn955CFTsEk2cq4Et","content":[{"title":"Main Technical Track: Call for Papers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/main-technical-track-call/"},{"title":"Overview of the AI Review System","url":"https://aaai.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/FAQ-for-the-AI-Assisted-Peer-Review-Process-Pilot-Program.pdf"},{"title":"ReviewerToo: Should AI Join The Program Committee? A Look At The Future of Peer Review","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2510.08867v1"},{"title":"AI-Assisted Peer Review at Scale: The AAAI-26 AI Review Pilot","url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2604.13940v1"},{"title":"Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/ethical-guidelines-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/"},{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/"},{"title":"Grant Peer Review: Improving Inter-Rater Reliability with Training","url":"htt