{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HYWG8MrrZWegjrwwsUbmhE","type":"tool_result","content":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Scoring Scale - Information Not Available\n\nBased on my review of the provided webpage content, **the specific scoring scale, rating criteria, and numerical score definitions for AAAI-26 reviewers are not included**.\n\n## What the Page Contains:\n\nThe review process documentation outlines the **structural approach**:\n\n- Two-phase review system with three initial reviewers per paper\n- Phase 1 rejection threshold for \"sufficiently negative reviews\"\n- Phase 2 with additional reviewers\n- Author feedback window (October 7-13, 2025)\n- Double-blind review requirements\n\n## What's Missing:\n\nThe page does **not provide**:\n- Numerical scoring scales (e.g., 1-5, 1-10)\n- Specific rating criteria definitions\n- Confidence score ranges\n- Sub-criteria for evaluation\n\n## Where to Find This Information:\n\nThe webpage references two relevant documents that likely contain this information:\n\n1. \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" (linked as a Google Doc)\n2. \"Ethical Guidelines for AAAI-26 Reviewers\" (available on the site)\n\nThese documents would need to be accessed directly to obtain the complete scoring rubric."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7653c71b-c80c-411e-b242-de88d6b84f6d","uuid":"37a7106a-2704-4efa-995b-0ac9106af57c","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:44:27.163Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":199885,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Scoring Scale - Information Not Available\n\nBased on my review of the provided webpage content, **the specific scoring scale, rating criteria, and numerical score definitions for AAAI-26 reviewers are not included**.\n\n## What the Page Contains:\n\nThe review process documentation outlines the **structural approach**:\n\n- Two-phase review system with three initial reviewers per paper\n- Phase 1 rejection threshold for \"sufficiently negative revi