{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EZkUYbYajEyUCd5S4D78Ua","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"AAAI 2025 2026 reviewer instructions overall recommendation score 1-10 scale accept reject\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"ReviewerToo: Should AI Join The Program Committee? A Look At The Future of Peer Review\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2510.08867v1\"},{\"title\":\"Thanks to reviewers list 2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12795292/\"},{\"title\":\"Thank you to our 2025 reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12905618/\"},{\"title\":\"Thank you to our 2025 reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12921489/\"},{\"title\":\"Thank you to our 2025 reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12853355/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/\"},{\"title\":\"AAAI-26 FAQ for Authors (Rebuttal) - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/aaai-26-faq-for-authors-rebuttal/\"},{\"title\":\"Main Technical Track: Call for Papers - AAAI\",\"url\":\"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/main-technical-track-call/\"}]\n\nI found information about AAAI-26 reviewer processes and review structure, but the search results don't contain specific details about the overall recommendation score scale (1-10) or the exact accept/reject criteria. Let me search more specifically for this information.\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AI-Assisted Peer Review at Scale: The AAAI-26 AI Review Pilot\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.