er categories. The conference may use different scale systems in different years, or the specific rating form definitions may not be publicly available online. For the most accurate and current information about AAAI's specific review form and rating scale meanings, I would recommend checking the official AAAI conference website directly or contacting the conference organizers.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7653c71b-c80c-411e-b242-de88d6b84f6d","uuid":"b3047682-84f6-4b44-aa08-f1014351e3a8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:45:22.193Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"AAAI conference review form \"overall score\" \"1\" \"10\" scale meaning strong accept reject","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01FXyEteJopy8Q77XGBmsGsJ","content":[{"title":"AAAI-26 Review Process Update: Scale, Integrity Measures, and Pathways to Sustainability - AAAI","url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/review-process-update/"},{"title":"AAAI 2025 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/aaai-statistics/aaai-2025-statistics/"},{"title":"32nd AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, AAAI 2018 - Impact Factor (IF), Overall Ranking, Rating, h-index, Call For Paper, Publisher, ISSN, Scientific Journal Ranking (SJR), Abbreviation, other Important Details | Resurchify","url":"https://www.resurchify.com/impact/details/21100896173"},{"title":"Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence - Impact Factor (IF), Overall Ranking, Rating, h-index, Call For Paper, Publisher, ISSN, Scientific Journal Ranking (SJR), Abbreviation, other Important Details | Resurchify","url":"https://www.resurchify.com/impact/details/21101185504"},{"title":"Matching Papers and Reviewers at Large Conferences","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2202.12273"}]},"Let me search more specifically for the AAAI review form rating scale definitions:",{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01VheQ