{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SZQVQKoKSrRR1Vxg6Cw7kB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 nlp_variance_gtheory 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (7 个)\\n\\n- **exp001_qwen**: RUNNING — \\n- **exp001_mistral**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp001_gemma**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp001_llama**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp001_pilot**: DONE (success) — \\n- **bf16_eager_disentangle**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_phase_a**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-21\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp001_qwen | Qwen3-8B variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) completes the 4-model design for cross-model G-theory analysis — tests whether item_id dominance and model×item interaction patterns hold with a 4th architecturally distinct model (Claim 1) | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp001_mistral** (success): Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) will contribute to cross-model G-theory analysis — model-as-facet tests whether item_id dominance holds across architecturally diverse models (Claim 1) ← 基于 exp001_llama\\n- **exp001_gemma** (success): Gemma-2-9b-it variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items) will show model-specific variance structure differences compared to Llama — enabling model-as-facet analysis (Claim 1 make-or-break) ← 基于 exp001_llama\\n- **exp001_llama** (success): Single-model (Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct) G-theory variance decomposition at full scale (1,296 conditions × 200 items across 3 precisions × 3 temperatures × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 4 orderings) will confirm MVP findings: item_id dominates binary_correct variance, while text_exact_match reveals infrastructure×methodology interactions ← 基于 mvp_phase_a\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 5 / 负向 1 / 失败 0 / 共 6\\nitems_per_condition: 200 →（近 3 次 success）\\ntotal_records: 259200 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-32570: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011a786N7e3BAGE6Aq8qDMf6","session_id":"7653c71b-c80c-411e-b242-de88d6b84f6d","uuid":"117f1a98-5bbb-41e4-8a3d-8abfc90fc310","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:47:27.796Z"}
